INSERT INTO `messages2` VALUES (547,'bobby-ball','Bobby Ball','bobby-ball-comedian.jpg','Robert Harper, known professionally as Bobby Ball, is an English comedian, actor, and singer. He is best known as one half of the double act Cannon and Ball, with Tommy Cannon. They hosted their own ITV show The Cannon and Ball Show for nine years between 1979 and 1988.','Entertainer & Actor',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>         ','@TheBobbyBall â€','No'),(548,'batman-super-hero','Batman','batman-superhero.jpg','Batman is a fictional superhero appearing in American comic books published by DC Comics. The character was created by artist Bob Kane and writer Bill Finger, and first appeared in Detective Comics Issue 27, in 1939','DC Comics Superhero',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>         ','@TheBatman','No'),(550,'big-shaun-band-musician','Big Sean','big-shaun-musician.jpg','The Everly Pregnant Brothers are a power house of parody fuelled on best bitter, pork pies and raucous gigs. They regularly play to sell out crowds in their native south yorkshire and are rapidly growing a cult following far and wide.','Everly Pregnant Brothers',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>         ','@EverlyPregnant','No'),(551,'clive-warren','Clive Warren','clive-warren-dj.jpg','Clive Warren is an award-winning British radio presenter whose career has taken him across some of the UKâ€™s biggest stations, including BBC Radio 1, Virgin Radio, Capital FM, Heart 106.2, Century FM, Metro Radio and Hallam FM. In 2014 he joined Smooth Radio North East, where his Drive Home show quickly became the regionâ€™s No.1 commercial programme. ','Radio DJ on Smooth North East',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>               ','@ThisisClive','No'),(552,'colin-patterson-bbc-presenter','Colin Patterson','colin-patterson-bbc.jpg','Colin Paterson is a Scottish journalist and broadcaster who is an Arts and Entertainment correspondent for the BBC and has been a presenter and reporter on BBC Three\'s Liquid News.','BBC Presenter',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>        ','@ColinGPaterson',''),(553,'romesh-ranganathan','Romesh Ranganathan','romesh-ranganathan-comedian.jpg','Romesh Ranganathan is a British stand-up comedian from Crawley, known for his dry wit, sharp observations and brilliantly honest storytelling. He first broke through in 2013 with a Best Newcomer nomination at the Edinburgh Comedy Awards. Since then, Romesh has become a TV favourite, appearing on countless panel shows and co-presenting Itâ€™s Not Rocket Science with Ben Miller and Rachel Riley. His 2018 autobiography, Straight Outta Crawley, was widely praised for its humour and candour.','Comedian',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>           ','@RomeshRanga','Yes'),(554,'zoe-lyons','Zoe Lyons','zoe-Lyons-comedian.jpg','Zoe Lyons is a Welsh comic who first appeared on TV on the show \'Survivor\' in 2001.  But it was three years later when she got her big break as she won the 2004 Funny Women awards. Lyons won great acclaim for her show \'Clownbusting\' in 2011. Lyons has appeared on several television and radio shows, including Mock the Week, the Paul O\'Grady Show, and Room 101. ','Stand up Comedian',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>          ','@zoelyons',''),(555,'corrie-andrew-lancel','Andrew Lancel','andrew-lancel-corrie-actor.jpg','Andrew Lancel is an English television and theatre actor, but he is also a producer and a director. Lancel is best known as Dr. Andrew Collin in the show Cardiac Arrest and for his role as DI Neil Manson in The Bill. Lancel received wide acclaim for his performance in the play \'Epstein\' of which he played the eponymous lead role: Brian Epstein. ','Coronation Street Actor','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>           ','@AndrewLancel',''),(556,'dan-walker-bbc-breakfast','Dan Walker','dan-walker-bbc-breakfast.jpg','Daniel Meirion Walker is an English journalist and television presenter, best known for presenting BBC television programmes including Football Focus and BBC Breakfast. ','BBC Breakfast Presenter',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>         ','@mrdanwalker','Yes'),(558,'pete-waterman','Pete Waterman','pete-waterman-songwriter.jpg','Peter Alan Waterman is an songwriter, radio and club DJ, television presenter, and the  president of Coventry Bears rugby league club. He has had a long, illustrious career that is almost impossible to summarise in this short blurb. Waterman is a member of the Stock Aitken Waterman songwriting team, he has written and produced many hit singles, working with the likes of Kylie Minogue, Rick Astley, Steps, Sinitta, and Jason Donovan. ','Record Producer & Songwriter','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@petewatermanobe',''),(560,'bernie-clifton','Bernie Clifton','bernie-clifton-entertainer.jpg','Born in St Helens, Lancashire, he began his career singing with a Gleenogs dance band before working the pubs and clubs, doing shows in Blackpool and then progressing on to television appearing on Crackerjack on the BBC in the 1970s. Now a presenter on BBC Radio Sheffield.','Comedian & Entertainer',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>        ','@bernieclifton',''),(561,'tosin-cole','Tosin Cole','tosin-cole-doctor-who-assistant.jpg','Tosin Cole is a British actor. He is known for various roles in British television series and films. He began his on-screen career starring in The Cut and EastEnders, later securing a regular role as Neil Cooper in the soap opera Hollyoaks. And now Dr Who\'s Assistant','Actor in Dr Who','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>          ','@mrtosincole',''),(563,'brendan-ocarroll-mrs-brown','Brendon O\'Carroll','brendan-o-carroll-actor-mrs-brown.jpg','Brendan O Carroll is an Irish writer, producer, comedian, actor, and director, best known for portraying foul-mouthed matriarch Agnes Brown on stage, and in the BBC and RTÃ‰ television sitcom Mrs. Browns Boys.','Actor & Comedian',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@brendanMrsBrown',''),(564,'chuckle-brothers','Chuckle Brothers','chuckle-brothers-tv-presenters.jpg','The Chuckle Brothers were a beloved English childrenâ€™s comedy duo made up of Barry and Paul Elliott, adored by generations for their slapstick humour and catchphrases. They were best known for the long-running BBC series ChuckleVision, which became a staple of 1990s and 2000s kidsâ€™ TV and celebrated its 21st series with a nationwide tour in 2010. Barry sadly passed away in 2018, but the joy and laughter the pair created continue to live on with fans.','TV Presenters & Actors',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>          ','@PaulChuckle2',''),(565,'eddie-howe-bournmouth-fc','Eddie Howe','eddie-howe-bournmouth-fc.jpg','Edward Howe is football manager for Premier League club AFC Bournemouth. Howe is a former player who spent a large portion of his career playing for Bournemouth â€” so the move to manager was no surprise. What was a surprise, however, was that Eddie Howe was the youngest manager in the entire Premier League! Howe rescued the club from relegation in his first year and has since helped his team prosper.','Bournemouth FC Football Manager',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>          ','@afcbournemouth',''),(566,'georgia-toff-toffalo-tv-personality','Georgia Toff Toffalo','georgia-toff-toffalo.jpg','Georgia Valerie Toff Toffolo is an English television and media personality. She is best known for appearing on E4 reality television series Made in Chelsea from 2014 and winning the seventeenth series of ITVs I\'m a Celebrity...Get Me Out of Here in 2017.','Television Personality',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>        ','@tofftalks',''),(567,'hacker-the-dog-cbbc','Hacker the Dog','hacker-the-dog.jpg','Hacker T. Dog, otherwise known as Hacker is one of the presenters of British childrens television service CBBC. He is a puppet Border Terrier from Wigan. He is the half-brother of Dodge T. Dog and is the son of Mrs. T. Dog.','CBBC TV Dog',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>        ','@CBBC_Hacker',''),(568,'iain-stirling-love-island-voice','Iain Stirling','iain-stirling-love-island-voice.jpg','Iain Andrew Stirling is a comedian, writer and television presenter from Edinburgh, Scotland.','Love Island Voice',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>        ','@IainDoesJokes',''),(569,'jarvis-cocker-pulp-singer','Jarvis Cocker','jarvis-cocker-singer.jpg','Jarvis Cocker is an English musician, famous as the frontman of the band Pulp. Pulp\'s sound and Cocker\'s enigmatic style pushed Jarvis to the top, as the figurehead of Britpop in the mid 90s. Pulp never broke up, but they took an extended break. Since then, Cocker pursued a solo career as a radio presentor, presenting Jarvis Cockers Sunday Service â€” a hit BBC Radio 6 Music show.','Singer & Songwriter',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>           ','','Yes'),(570,'joanne-clifton-dancer','Joanne Clifton','joanne-clifton-dancer.jpg','Joanne Clifton, is a British professional dancer, presenter, actress, and singer. She won the World Ballroom Showdance Championship in 2013, and won the European Professional Ballroom Championship and World Dancesport Games.','Professional Dancer',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>         ','@joanneclifton',''),(571,'joe-lycett-comedian','Joe Lycett','joe-lycett-comedian.jpg','Joe Harry Lycett is a British comedian who first made his big break as the Chortle Student Comedian of the Year in 2009. He was also a finalist in the 2011 BBC New Comedy Awards.  Lycett has performed Live at the Apollo, Never Mind the Buzzcocks, 8 Out of 10 Cats, Taskmaster, and QI.  Lycett iis more of TV personality, but he has also appeared as a guest of several prominent radio shows, including Greg James, and Nick Grimshaw\'s radio programmes. ','Standup Comedian',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>    ','@joelycett','Yes'),(572,'jools-holland-musician','Jools Holland','jools-holland-musician.jpg','Jools Holland is an English musician and television host. He was an original member of the band Squeeze. However, Holland is most famous for his BB2 music show called Later... with Jools Holland, where he has an incredibly diverse range of musicians perform live on the show. He also hosts his annual New Year\'s Eve music show called Hootenanny.','Singer & Musician',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>          ','@BBCLater',''),(573,'jordan-north-katie-thisleton-cell-spellman-djs','Jordan, Katie & Cell','jordan-north-katie-thisleton-cell-spellman-djs.jpg','Jordan North, Katie Thistleton and Cel Spellman are three vibrant presenters who made a strong mark on BBC Radio 1. Jordan became a listener favourite with his high-energy weekend shows and later reached a wider audience on Iâ€™m a Celebrityâ€¦ Get Me Out of Here!. Katie co-hosted Going Home, fronted Life Hacks and is a passionate mental-health advocate. Cel co-presented Life Hacks with Katie while continuing his acting career, including roles in Cold Feet. Together, they brought warmth, humour and meaningful conversations to Radio 1.','BBC Radio 1 DJs',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>         ','@BBCR1',''),(574,'michael-palin-entertainer','Michael Palin','michael-palin-entertainer.jpg','Michael Palin is a legendary English comedian, actor, writer and presenter, best known as a founding member of Monty Python. He co-wrote much of the groupâ€™s classic material with Terry Jones, helping shape the landscape of British comedy. Later, Palin reinvented himself as a celebrated travel documentarian, fronting acclaimed series that showcased his warmth and curiosity about the world. He is also an advocate for public transport through his support of the Campaign for Better Transport.','TV Presenter & Entertainer',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>            ','','Yes'),(575,'peter-crouch-footballer','Peter Crouch','peter-crouch-footballer.jpg','Peter Crouch is a professional English footballer who played as a striker for Championship club Stoke City until his transfer to Burnley. Crouch has played for England\'s international team 42 times between 2005 and 2010, scoring 22 goals for his country. Crouch has appeared in two world cups and he will be remembered as one of the most admired English footballers of his generation. ','Stoke City Footballer',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>          ','@petercrouch','Yes'),(576,'richard-arnold-gmb-presenter','Richard Arnold','richard-arnold-gmb-presenter.jpg','Richard Arnold is an English television presenter from Andover, Hampshire. Arnold also spent a good part of his formative years in Inverurie, Aberdeenshire. Arnold went to the University of Edinburgh. Arnold\'s first job on television was on the BBC\'s The Sunday Show. Then he was on the show GMTV, and then he had his own show, called The Richard Arnold Show, then Good Morning Britain.','GMB Showbiz Presenter',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>          ','@RichardAArnold','Yes'),(577,'ruth-madoc-actress','Ruth Madoc','ruth-madoc-actress.jpg','Ruth Madoc is a British actress and singer. She is best known for her role as Gladys Pugh in the 1980s BBC television comedy Hi-de-Hi, for which she received a BAFTA TV award nomination for Best Light Entertainment Performance, and as Daffyd Thomas mother in the second series of Little Britain. ','Hi-Di-Hi Actress',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>        ','@ruth_madoc',''),(578,'samantha-bumford','Samantha Bumford','samantha-bumford.jpg','Samantha Bumford, from Poole and the current Miss Poole and Miss Dorset 2017. Graduated from the University of Portsmouth','Miss Poole 2018',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>        ','@samanthalouemma',''),(579,'shaun-wallace-dark-destroyer','Shaun Wallace','shaun-wallace.jpg','Shaun Anthony Linford Wallace is an English television personality and a barrister. He is a Chaser on the ITV quiz show The Chase. Wallace is also a part-time lecturer and often visits schools, colleges and other institutions to educate students on the many aspects of law.','The Chase - The Dark Destroyer',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>        ','@TheShaunWallace',''),(580,'steph-mcgovern','Steph McGovern','steph-mcgovern.jpg','Stephanie Rose McGovern is an English journalist and television presenter. She works for the BBC and is the main business presenter for BBC Breakfast. She sometimes co-hosts the entire programme.','BBC Breakfast Presenter','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@stephbreakfast','Yes'),(581,'stu-francis-personality','Stu Francis','stu-francis-personality.jpg','Stuart G. G. Stu Francis is a British comedian with a camp style of delivery who achieved celebrity as lead presenter on the childrens television programme Crackerjack. His principal co host was Basil Brush.','TV Personality',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>        ','',''),(582,'toby-foster-bbc-dj','Toby Foster','toby-foster-bbc-dj.jpg','Toby Foster is a British comedian, actor, radio presenter, promoter and festival producer. He went to the Barnburgh Junior School, followed by Lacewood Primary School, Dearneside Comprehensive and Wath Comprehensive in Rotherham. He is the current host of BBC Radio Sheffields breakfast programme. ','Radio Presenter',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>         ','@tobyfoster',''),(583,'tommy-cannon-comedian','Tommy Cannon','tommy-cannon-comedian.jpg','Thomas Derbyshire, known professionally as Tommy Cannon, is an English comedian and singer. He is best known as the straight man of comedy double act Cannon and Ball, along with Bobby Ball. He is most well known for the show The Cannon and Ball Show. Cannon was chairman of Rochdale Football Club until 1988.','Entertainer & Actor',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>        ','@TheTommyCannon',''),(585,'alesha-dixon-singer-presenter','Alesha Dixon','alesha-dixon-singer-presenter.jpg','Alesha Dixon is a British singer and rapper who first shot to fame with the R&B group Mis-Teeq. She later became a household name after winning Strictly Come Dancing in 2007, which led to a successful TV career. Alesha went on to judge Britainâ€™s Got Talent and has since presented numerous programmes, mainly for the BBC. Her mix of musical talent, charisma and on-screen confidence has made her one of the UKâ€™s most recognisable entertainers.','Singer & Television Presenter','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>     ','@AleshaOfficial','Yes'),(586,'alistair-mcgowen-impressionist-actor','Alistair McGowan','alistair-mcgowen-impressionist.jpg','Alistair Charles McGowan is an English impressionist and comic known for The Big Impression. The Big Impression was a huge hit in the UK, and one of the BBC\'s top comedy programmes â€“ even winning various awards â€“ including a BAFTA in 2003. McGowan\'s impressions were a prominent feature on British televisions for many years. Some of his best impressions were of Terry Wogan, Tony Blair, Prince Charles, and David Beckham.','Actor & Impressionist','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>        ','@AlistairMcGowa3',''),(587,'rhod-gilbert-comedian','Rhod Gilbert','rhod-gilbert-comedian.jpg','Rhod Gilbert\'s is a much-loved Welsh comedian who has been nominated for many different awards, including the 2005 Perrier Best Newcomer Award, 2006\'s The Times\' Top 50 Comedians, Chortle \'Comic\'s Comc\' award, and many more. He has been a regular guest of a range of panel shows including Have I Got News for You, Never Mind the Buzzcocks, and 8 out of 10 Cats.','Actor & Comedian','  <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>         ','@rhodgilbertshow',''),(588,'krankies-comedians','The Krankies','krankies-comedians.jpg','played by Janette and Ian Tough, the Krankies were a Scottish comedy duo. They had a successful cabaret act in the 1970s and were a big feature on television in the 80s. The Krankies had their own TV shows and they released their own music single and album, titled Tan-Dabi-Dozi. The Krankies have regularly appeared in pantomime productions across the UK.','Comedy Duo','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>        ','@TheKrankiesUK',''),(589,'david-walliams-comedian-writer','David Walliams','david-walliams-comedian-writer.jpg','David Edward Williams OBE, known professionally as David Walliams, is a British actor, comedian, author, talent show judge and presenter known for his partnership with Matt Lucas on the BBC One sketch show Little Britain. Since 2012, Walliams has been a judge on the ITV talent show Britains Got Talent.','Actor, Comedian, & Author',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>           ','@davidwalliams','Yes'),(590,'davina-presenter-television-presenter','Davina McCall','davina-mccall-tv-presenter.jpg','Davina Lucy Pascale McCall is an English television presenter and model. She was the presenter of Big Brother during its run on Channel 4 between 2000 and 2010. She has also hosted Channel 4s The Million Pound Drop, Five Minutes to a Fortune and The Jump as well as ITVs Long Lost Family and This Time Next Year. ','Television Presenter','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@ThisisDavina','Yes'),(591,'chris-eubank-jnr-boxer','Chris Eubank Junior','chris-eubank-boxer.jpg','Christopher Eubank Junior is a British professional boxer who has more than earned his own fame outside of his father\'s shadow. From 2017 to 2018, Chris Eubank Jr held the IBO super-middleweight title. Before that, he held the WBA interim and British middleweight titles, from 2015 to 2016.  On March 2019, Eubank was ranked second in the world\'s active super-middleweight boxers. ','Professional Boxer','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>          ','@ChrisEubankJr',''),(594,'andy-crane-tv-presenter','Andy Crane','andy-crane-tv-presenter.jpg','Howard Andrew Andy Crane (usually referred to as Andy Crane) is an English television and radio presenter. Crane is best known for presenting Children\'s BBC between 1987 and 1990 and for his current work as breakfast presenter on the Bauer City 2 network. In 2019, Andy became the presenter on Greatest Hits Radio.','Television and Radio Presenter','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>        ','@andycrane64',''),(595,'tristan-gemmill-corrie-actor','Tristan Gemmill','tristan-gemmill-corrie-actor.jpg','Tristan John Gemmill is an English actor, most notable for his role as Dr Adam Trueman on Casualty. He was educated at Holmewood House School, Tunbridge Wells, Kent, up to the age of 13. He then won an Academic Scholarship to Tonbridge School.','Coronation Street Actor','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@TristanGemmill',''),(596,'gemma-atkinson-and-gethin-jones-radio-tv-personalities','Gemma Atkinson & Gethin Jones','gemma-atkinson-and-gethin-jones-radio-tv-personalities.jpg','Gemma Louise Atkinson is an English actress and former glamour model. She is best known for playing Lisa Hunter on Hollyoaks. Meanwhile Gethin Jones is a Welsh television presenter. An active rugby union player while at Manchester Metropolitan University and, for a time, after graduation, Jones began his television career.','Hits Radio Presenters',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>         ','@hitsradiouk',''),(597,'brooke-vincent-actress','Brooke Vincent','brooke-vincent-actress.jpg','Brooke Vincent is an English actress known for playing Sophie Webster in Coronation Street since 2004. Brooke didn\'t start off as Sohpie Webster, however; she actually she took over the role from Emma Woodward. Brooke Vincent was born in Audnshaw, Greater Manchester, and her first TV role was actually in the black comedy show, The League of Gentlemen.','Actress','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@BrookeLVincent',''),(598,'dani-harmer-tracy-beeker-actress','Dani Harmer','dani-harmer-tracy-beeker.jpg','Danielle Jane Harmer is an actress and former singer who is best known for her portrayal as Tracy Beaker in the CBBC programmes The Story of Tracy Beaker, Tracy Beaker Returns and Tracy Beaker Survival Files from 2002 to 2012. She also appeared in the BBC sitcom, After Youve Gone.','Actress',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>','@DaniHarmer',''),(599,'hayley-tamerddon-corrie-actress','Hayley Tamaddon','hayley-tamerddon-corrie-actress.jpg','Hayley Soraya Tamaddon is a British actress of Iranian descent, who is best known for her roles as Del Dingle in Emmerdale, Andrea Beckett in Coronation Street and as Calista in Shameless. Tamaddon won the fifth series of Dancing on Ice on 28 March 2010, with skating partner Daniel Whiston.','Actress',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@hayleysoraya',''),(600,'matthew-wolfenden-emerdale-actor','Matthew Wolfenden','matthew-wolfenden-emerdale-actor.jpg','ðŸŽ­ Matthew Wolfenden is an English actor, best known for his long-running role as David Metcalfe in the British soap opera Emmerdale. ðŸŒŸ With his compelling performances, Matthew has become a familiar face in UK households. ðŸ“º His portrayal of the complex and often controversial character has earned him recognition and a dedicated fanbase. ','Actor','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@mrmattwolfenden',''),(601,'mark-dolan-comedian','Mark Dolan','mark-dolan-comedian.jpg','ðŸŽ­ Mark Dolan is an English comedian, writer, and television presenter, best known for hosting the Channel 4 show Balls of Steel from 2005 to 2008. ðŸŒŸ With his sharp wit and bold humour, Mark made a lasting impact on British television. ðŸŽ¤ He continues to entertain audiences with his unique style of comedy and insightful commentary. ','Comedian, Writer, and TV Presenter.','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@mrmarkdolan',''),(602,'ross-noble-comedian','Ross Noble','ross-noble-comedian.jpg','Ross Noble is stand-up comic from Newcastle upon Tyne. Noble\'s unique sense of humour is loved throughout the UK and he has had several sell-out tours and comedy DVDs. He initially rose to fame by appearing on British panel shows such as Have I Got News for You. Noble was the Time Out \'Best Comic\' winner in 2000 and he has proven just as popular in Australia as he is in the UK. Famously, Noble encourages heckling becuase he likes each performance to be as unique as possible. ','Comedian & Actor',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@realrossnoble',''),(603,'roy-chubby-brown-comedian','Roy Chubby Brown','roy-chubby-brown-comedian.jpg','Roy Chubby Brown, born Royston Vasey, is an English stand-up comedian known for his bold and blue humour. Famous for his free-speaking style and disregard for political correctness, Roy has gained both success and controversy throughout his career. His shows, often not aired on mainstream TV due to their controversial nature, continue to draw a loyal fanbase who regularly attend his performances. ','Comedian',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>    ','@OfficialChubby',''),(604,'steff-todd-comedian','Steff Todd','steff-todd-comedian.jpg','An award winning new comedian from Yorkshire who has made a name for herself with hilarious impressions, an impeccable wit and razor sharp one-liners.','Comedian & Impressionist',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>','@SteffTodd',''),(605,'ainsley-harriott-len-goodman-dancer-chef','Ainsley Harriott & Len Goodman','ainsley-harriott-len-goodman-dancer-chef.jpg','Ainsley Harriott is a hugely popular English TV chef, best known for BBC hits Canâ€™t Cook, Wonâ€™t Cook and Ready Steady Cook. Loved for his humour and infectious energy, he became a household favourite.\r\nLen Goodman was an English professional ballroom dancer before becoming head judge on Strictly Come Dancing from 2004 to 2016. After Strictly, he continued to present and appear in a range of BBC shows, cementing his status as a beloved TV personality.','Chef and Professional Dancer','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>    ','@GrumpyLGoodman',''),(606,'craig-revel-horwood-dancer-presenter','Craig Revel Horwood','craig-revel-horwood-dancer.jpg','Craig Revel Horwood is an Australian-British dancer, choreographer and theatre director, best known as a long-standing judge on Strictly Come Dancing. Famous for his sharp critiques and trademark â€œdahling,â€ heâ€™s become one of the showâ€™s most recognisable personalities. Living in the UK, Craig is a patron of the National Osteoporosis Society and published his autobiography in 2008. He remains a key figure on Strictly, bringing wit, expertise and uncompromising standards to the judging panel.','British Dancer','Brce Davis     ','@CraigRevHorwood','Yes'),(607,'brendan-cole-dancer','Brendan Cole','brendan-cole-dancer.jpg','Brendan Cole is a ballroom dancer from New Zealand famous for his part in the British Strictly Come Dancing. Specialising in Latin American dancing, Cole is capable across the breadth of ballroom styles on the show, and he is famous for sometimes arguing with the show\'s judges. Brendan Cole was was in Strictly from 2005 to 2009, then he was a judge on New Zealand\'s version of the Strictly: Dancing with the Stars.','British Pro Dancer','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@BrendanCole',''),(608,'pasha-kovalev-dancer','Pasha Kovalev','pasha-kovalev-dancer.jpg','Pasha Kovalev is a Russian-born professional dancer best known in the UK for his long-running role on Strictly Come Dancing. He began dancing at the age of eight and later moved to the United States in 2001 with his dance partner Anya Garnis. Pasha joined Strictly in 2010, quickly becoming a fan favourite for his skill and charm. In 2019, he married Rachel Riley, the mathematician and presenter from Countdown.','Russian professional dancer','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@PashaKovalev',''),(609,'anton-and-erin-dancers','Anton & Erin','anton-and-erin-dancers.jpg','Anton Du Beke is a British ballroom dancer and TV favourite, best known as one of the original stars of Strictly Come Dancing. Loved for his old-school charm, heâ€™s been a fixture on the show since 2004. Erin Boag, born in Auckland, is a fellow professional dancer who also graced Strictly, having trained in ballet before moving into ballroom, Latin and jazz. Together, Anton and Erin are celebrated for their classic ballroom elegance.','Pro Ballroom Dance Couple','Bruce Davis  ','@TheAntonDuBeke',''),(617,'hugh-dennis-comedian-actor','Hugh Dennis','hugh-dennis-comedian-actor.jpg','Hugh Dennis is an English comedian. Dennis is famous for working with Steve Punt on the show Punt and Dennis, but he is best known for his role as Pete Brockman, the father in the BBC show Outnumbered.  Dennis is also a regular on Mock the Week and made an appearance in James Bond, No time to die in 2021.','Actor & Comedian','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>    ','@mrhughdennis','Yes'),(618,'lesley-garrett-soprano-singer','Lesley Garrett','lesley-garrett-singer.jpg','Lesley Garrett is an English soprano singer and musician, but she is also a much-loved media personality. Garrett\'s background in opera doesn\'t restrict her from trying other forms of music; in fact, she is known for experimenting in various forms of crossover between different musical genres with opera. Taking part in shows like This Morning and Loose Morning, Garrett, is a regular figure on British televisions. ','Soprano Singer','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@garrettsgossip',''),(619,'jason-manford-comedian','Jason Manford','jason-manford-comedian.jpg','Jason Manford is an English comedian, radio presentor, and television presenter. Manford is best known for serving as a team captain on 8 Out of 10 Cats from 2007 until 2010.  However, Manford has been part of numerous other TV shows, including The One Show, Show Me the Funny, A Question of Sport, and Bigheads. Origianlly from Manchester, Manford has also enjoyed a successful stand-p comedy career.','Comedian & Radio Presenter','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@JasonManford','Yes'),(620,'john-marquez-actor','John Marquez','john-marquez-actor.jpg','John Charles Marquez is a British actor and cinematographer, best known for his role as PC Joe Penhale in ITV drama series Doc Martin and Ray Wilson in BBC One\'s drama In The Club.','British Actor','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','',''),(621,'gary-wilmot-actor','Gary Wilmot','gary-wilmot-actor.jpg','Harold Owen \"Gary\" Wilmot, MBE is an English singer, actor, and comedian who rose to fame as a contestant on New Faces. As a television presenter, he is best known as the host of So You Want To Be Top and Showstoppers.','Actor & Singer','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>          ','@garywilmotactor',''),(622,'john-barrowman-actor','John Barrowman','john-barrowman-actor.jpg','John Barrowman MBE is a Scottish-American actor and singer. Originally born in Glasgow, Barrowman moved to the US when he was a boy and lost most of his Scottish accent â€” however, the accent occasionally returns when he\'s arround other Scottish people. Barrowman is a big personality and his talents extend far beyond acting and singing: he is also apresenter, author, and comic book writer. ','Actor','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>            ','@JohnBarrowman',''),(623,'joey-essex-only-way-is-essex','Joey Essex','joey-essex-only-way-is-essex.jpg','Joey Essex is an English television personality who first earned his fame by appearing in 2011 by appearing in the ITV2 television series The Only Way Is Essex with various members of his family and some of his friends.  In 2013, Joey Essex and his sister Frankie left the show. Since TOWIE, Joey has appeared in I\'m a Celebrity Get Me Out of Here, Celebs Go Dating, and The Jump.','Television personality','Photo: Bruce Davis','@JoeyEssex_','No'),(624,'freddie-flintoff-england-cricketer','Freddie Flintoff','freddie-flintoff-england-cricketer.jpg','Andrew \"Freddie\" Flintoff is a former English cricketer who played mostly for Lancashire. The interesting thing about Flintoff as a cricketer was that he was one of the sport\'s true all rounders as he was a fast bowler, slip fielder, and amiddle order batsman. After an impressive sporting career, Flintoff discovered that he had talent as a television presentor; he has presented A League of Their Own, Cannonball, and Top Gear.','Cricketer','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>    ','@flintoff11','Yes'),(625,'nick-clegg-mp','Nick Clegg','nick-clegg-mp.jpg','ðŸŽ™ï¸ Sir Nicholas William Peter Clegg, better known as Nick Clegg, is a former British politician who served as the leader of the Liberal Democrats from 2007 to 2015. ðŸŒŸ During the coalition between the Lib Dems and the Conservative Party, Nick became Deputy Prime Minister of the UK. ðŸ›ï¸ His role in the coalition government marked a significant period in British politics. ','Former Deputy Prime Minister','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>    ','@nick_clegg',''),(626,'dennis-taylor-snooker-player','Dennis Taylor','dennis-taylor-steve-davis-snooker-player.jpg','Dennis Taylor is a retired professional snooker player and current BBC snooker commentator. Winner of two ranking events, he is best known for winning the 1985 World Championship, beating World number one Steve Davis on the final black in one of the sport\'s most memorable finals. (pictured here also)','Snooker player','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@dennistaylor147',''),(627,'ken-docherty-snooker-player','Ken Docherty','ken-docherty-snooker-player.jpg','Ken Doherty is an Irish professional snooker player, commentator and radio presenter. As an amateur, Doherty won the Irish Amateur Championship twice, the World Under-21 Amateur Championship and the World Amateur Championship. ','Irish snooker player','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@kendoherty1997',''),(628,'stuart-bingham-snooker-player','Stuart Bingham','stuart-bingham-snooker-player.jpg','Stuart Bingham is an English professional snooker player and a one time World Snooker Champion. As an amateur, he won the 1996 IBSF World Snooker Championship. He first entered the top 32 in the world rankings for the 2006/2007 season, and first reached the top 16 during the 2011/2012 season.','Snooker Player','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@Stuart__Bingham',''),(629,'mr-maker-cbeebies-presenter','Mr Maker','mr-maker-cbeebies-presenter.jpg','Mister Maker is a preschool television series for CBeebies. Mister Maker does something interesting and that gives him an idea of what to make. He collects the required things from the Doodle drawers or an art and craft shop and makes it. ','Television Presenter','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@mistermaker',''),(630,'tom-daley-olympic-diver','Tom Daley','tom-daley-olympic-diver.jpg','Tom Daley is a British diver and TV personality. Thomas Robert Daley is a British diver and television personality. Specialising in multiple events, he is an Olympic gold medallist in the men\'s synchronized 10-metre platform event at the 2020 Olympics','Diver','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>    ','@TomDaley1994','Yes'),(631,'yvette-cooper-mp','Yvette Cooper','yvette-cooper-mp.jpg','Yvette Cooper is a Labour Party politician. She has been the Member of Parliament for Normanton, Pontefract and Castleford since 2010. Cooper has served as Shadow Home Secretary and she took part in the 2015 Labour leader election, losing to Jeremy Corbyn.','Member of Parliament ','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@YvetteCooperMP',''),(632,'paul-burling-impressionist-bgt','Paul Burling','paul-burling-impressionist-bgt.jpg','Paul Burling is a British impressionist. A veteran of show business for 25 years, having worked in voiceover, radio and pantomime, he rose to national attention as a finalist of the fourth series of Britain\'s Got Talent.','British impressionist','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@RealPaulBurling',''),(633,'shaun-murphy-snooker-player','Shaun Murphy','shaun-murphy-snooker-player.jpg','Shaun Peter Murphy is an English professional snooker player, who won the 2005 World Championship. Nicknamed \"The Magician\", Murphy is noted for his straight cue action and his long potting. Born in Harlow and raised in Irthlingborough, Murphy turned professional in 1998.','English snooker player','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@Magician147',''),(634,'iwan-thomas-athlete','Ivan Thomas','iwan-thomas-athlete.jpg','Ivan Alfred Astley Thomas is an English professional cricketer who plays for Kent County Cricket Club. He is a right-arm medium-fast seam bowler who bats right-handed. He made his first-class cricket debut for Leeds/Bradford MCC Universities in March 2012 and has played in all forms of cricket for Kent.','Cricketer','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@ivanthomas_5',''),(635,'john-parrott-snooker-player','John Parrott','john-parrott-snooker-player.jpg','John Parrott, MBE is an English former professional snooker player and television personality, remembered as one of the best players in the early 1990s. Parrott won the World Snooker Championship in 1991, defeating Jimmy White in the final.','English snooker player','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@JohnParrottCueS',''),(636,'marco-fu-snooker-player','Marco Fu','marco-fu-snooker-player.jpg','Marco Fu Ka-chun, MH, JP is a professional snooker player from Hong Kong. He won the 2007 Grand Prix, beating Ronnie O\'Sullivan in the final, and was the runner-up in the 2008 UK Championship and the 2011 Masters.','Hong Kong Pro Snooker Player','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@Marcofu18',''),(637,'anthony-mcgill-snooker-player','Anthony McGill','anthony-mcgill-snooker-player.jpg','Anthony McGill is a Scottish professional snooker player. He is a practice partner of Alan McManus. McGill turned professional in 2010, after finishing fourth in the 2009/2010 PIOS rankings. McGill won the 2016 Indian Open after having never been beyond the quarter-final stage of a ranking event previously.','Snooker player','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@antsmcgill',''),(638,'jamie-raven-magician-bgt','Jamie Raven','jamie-raven-magician-bgt.jpg','Magician Jamie Raven wowed the judges and audiences on 2015\'s Britain\'s Got Talent. His audition on Britainâ€™s got Talent, which has had over 11 million hits on YouTube alone, catapulted him straight through to the final with his incredible magic. From summoning up helicopters to reading the judges minds, he won the hearts of the UK public by becoming the most successful magician in BGT history.','Magician','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@jamieravenmagic',''),(639,'diana-vickers-singer','Diana Vickers','diana-vickers-singer.jpg','Diana Vickers is an English singer, songwriter, who initially came to public attention as a semi-finalist on The X Factor in 2008. In 2009, Vickers signed a record deal with RCA Records and played the title role in a West End revival of The Rise and Fall of Little Voice next event.','Singer & Songwriter','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@DianaVickers',''),(640,'ben-haenow-singer','Ben Haenow','ben-haenow-singer.jpg','Benjamin Bernard \"Ben\" Haenow is a British singer. He won the eleventh series of The X Factor in 2014. Following his win, his debut single, a cover of OneRepublic\'s \"Something I Need\", was released in December 2014. It debuted at number one on the UK Singles Chart, becoming the 2014 Christmas number one.','Singer & Songwriter','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@BenHaenow',''),(641,'steven-arnold-actor','Steven Arnold','steven-arnold-actor.jpg','Steven Arnold is an English actor known for playing Ashley Peacock in Coronation Street. Originally from Warrington, England, Arnold was part of a National Film an Television School production of \'This Boy\'s Story\' which won the \'Best Short Film\' award in 1991. Since leaving Coronation Street Arnold has had a successful acting career for both screen and stage.  In 2016, Arnold was cast as Chief Inspector Holt in The Blazing Cannons. ','Actor','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@StevenArnoldUK',''),(642,'shaun-williamson-barry-eastenders-actor','Shaun Williamson','shaun-williamson-barry-eastenders-actor.jpg','Shaun Williamson is an English actor, singer, media personality, and occasional presenter, best known for his role as Barry Evans in EastEnders and as a satirical version of himself in the BBC/HBO sitcom Extras. ','Actor','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@ShaunWilliamson','No'),(643,'rupert-hill-coronation-street-actor','Rupert Hill','rupert-hill-coronation-street-actor.jpg','Rupert Sinclair Hill is an English actor. He is known for his roles in several soap operas. Rupert Hill started with small roles on television. He appeared in one episode of EastEnders as Robbie\'s half-brother Kevin Bolton, and also played a part in a music video by the band Haven.','Actor','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@RupertHill',''),(644,'laurel-and-hardy-comedians','Laurel and Hardy','laurel-and-hardy-comedians.jpg','Laurel and Hardy were a comedy double act during the early Classical Hollywood era of American cinema. The team was composed of Englishman Stan Laurel and American Oliver Hardy.','Comedy duo','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@laurel_hardy',''),(645,'norman-pace-actor-comedian','Norman Pace','norman-pace-actor-comedian.jpg','Norman Pace is an English actor and comedian, best known as one half of the comedy duo Hale and Pace with his friend and comic partner Gareth Hale. Both former teachers, they fronted several television programmes jointly, most notably Hale and Pace, Pushing Up Daisies, h&p@bbc and Jobs for the Boys.','Actor','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@HaleAndPace',''),(646,'martyn-ware-heaven-17-musician','Martin Ware','martyn-ware-heaven-17-musician.jpg','Martyn Ware is an English musician, composer, arranger, record producer, and music programmer. As a founding member of both The Human League and Heaven 17, Ware was partly responsible for hit songs such as \"Being Boiled\" and \"Temptation\".','Musician','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@martynware',''),(647,'sam-bailey-x-factor-winner','Sam Bailey','sam-bailey-x-factor-winner.jpg','Samantha Florence \"Sam\" Bailey is an English singer, songwriter and musicals actress, known for winning the tenth series of The X Factor in 2013. Following her win, her debut single, a cover of Demi Lovato\'s \"Skyscraper\" was released on 15 December 2013, achieving the Christmas number one on 22 December 2013.','Singer & Songwriter','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@SamBaileyREAL',''),(648,'darius-campbell-singer','Darius Campbell','darius-campbell-singer.jpg','Darius Campbell-Danesh is usually simply known as Darious. He is a Scottish singer, songwriter, musician, and sometime actor. Darius first became famous for taking part in the TV talent show Pop Idol and winning the Popstar to Operastar contest in 2010/11. Darius is currently an ambassador for The Prince\'s Trust and he played Billy Flynn in the West End\'s production of Chicago. ','Scottish singer','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@DariusCampbell',''),(649,'mungo-jerry-singer','Mungo Jerry','mungo-jerry-singer.jpg','Mungo Jerry is a British rock group, best known for their success in the early 1970s, with their most famous hit In the Summertime. ðŸŒŸ Led by Ray Dorset, the band has had a changing lineup over the years but has remained a prominent figure in British rock. ðŸŽ¸ The groupâ€™s name was inspired by T.S. Eliot\'s poem Mungojerrie and Rumpleteazer from Old Possum\'s Book of Practical Cats. ','Singer & Songwriter','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@MungoJerryLTD',''),(650,'paul-s-club-7-singer','Paul Cattermole','paul-s-club-7-singer.jpg','Paul Gerald Cattermole is an English singer and actor. Cattermole was a member of the group S Club 7, but left the group in 2002. Between 2008 and 2015 he also was member of spin-off group S Club 3.','Singer','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@Paulcattermole1',''),(651,'pixie-lott-singer','Pixie Lott','pixie-lott-singer.jpg','ðŸŽµ Pixie Lott, born Victoria Louise Lott, is a British singer, songwriter, and actress, known for her chart-topping hits like Mama Do and Boys and Girls, both of which hit number one in the UK in 2009. ðŸŒŸ Pixieâ€™s powerful voice and catchy pop songs earned her widespread recognition. ðŸŽ­ In 2016, she showcased her acting skills, starring as Holly Golightly in the West End production of Breakfast at Tiffany\'s. ','Singer & Songwriter','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>     ','@PixieLott','Yes'),(652,'david-davies-former-executive-director-of-FA','David Davies','david-davies-former-executive-director-of-FA.jpg','David Davies OBE is a British broadcaster and consultant, formerly the Executive Director of The Football Association in England. He is a regular contributor to BBC News television and radio programmes and other networks.','British broadcaster','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@ddaviesofficial',''),(653,'greg-rusedski-tennis-player','Greg Rusedski','greg-rusedski-tennis-player.jpg','Gregory Rusedski is a tennis player whose duel citizenship in Canada and Britain allowed him to represent both nations at different times of his career. Rusedski made it to the final of the US Open is 1997 â€” a feat that earned him that year\'s BBC Sports Personality of the Year. Rusedski had an illustrative career as a tennis player before retiring and working as a tennis commentator and journalist.','British-Canadian tennis player','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@GregRusedski1','Yes'),(654,'danny-willett-professional-golfer','Danny Willett','danny-willett-professional-golfer.jpg','Daniel John Willett is an English professional golfer who plays on the European Tour. In April 2016, he won his first major championship at the 2016 Masters Tournament, becoming only the second Englishman to achieve the feat and the first European in 17 years to win at Augusta National. ','English professional golfer','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@Danny_Willett',''),(655,'eamonn-holmes-tv-personailty','Eamonn Holmes','eamonn-holmes-tv-personailty.jpg','Eamonn Holmes is a well-known television presenter, celebrated for hosting programmes such as GMTV, Sky News and This Morning. Before moving into broadcasting, Eamonn had early ambitions in football and has spoken about training with Northern Irish side Linfield, attracting interest from major English clubs. He ultimately chose a career in journalism and television instead, becoming one of the UKâ€™s most familiar and trusted presenters.','Journalist & TV Personality','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@EamonnHolmes','Yes'),(656,'ali-carter-snooker-player','Ali Carter','ali-carter-snooker-player.jpg','Allister Carter (usually referred to as Ali Carter) is an English professional snooker player with two World Championship runner-up performances, losing only to Ronnie O\'Sullivan, in 2008 and 2012. Ali has also won four ranking titles and been as high as second in the world rankings at different times in his career. As Ali spends his free time piloting planes, his nickname is \'The Captain\'.  ','Snooker player','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@TheCaptain147',''),(657,'dominic-dale-snooker-player','Dominic Dale','dominic-dale-snooker-player.jpg','Dominic Dale is a Welsh professional snooker player and occasional snooker commentator and presenter for the BBC. He is often referred to by commentators as the greatest player never to have been in the top 16.','Snooker player','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','',''),(658,'graeme-garden-comedian','Graeme Garden','graeme-garden-comedian.jpg','David Graeme Garden OBE is a British comedian, actor, author, artist and television presenter, best known as a member of The Goodies and for being a cast member on I\'m Sorry I Haven\'t a Clue.','British comedian','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@GraemeGarden1',''),(659,'willie-thorne-snooker-player','Willie Thorne','willie-thorne-snooker-player.jpg','William Joseph \"Willie\" Thorne is an English former professional snooker player who is now a sports commentator. He is most famous for winning the 1985 Classic.','Sports commentator','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@TheWillieThorne',''),(660,'steve-mcfadden-actor-phil-mitchell','Steve McFadden','steve-mcfadden-actor-phil-mitchell.jpg','Steve McFadden is an English actor famous for playing Phil Mitchell in the BBC soap opera EastEnders. McFadden has played Phil Mitchell since 1990 and an icon of British television. McFadden also presented a fighting series in the UK called \'Britain\'s Hardest\'. He also appeared on The Bill, Minder, and Bergerac before starting as Phil Mitchell on Eastenders. ','Actor','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@stevemcfadden_',''),(661,'kim-marsh-corrie-actress','Kim Marsh','kim-marsh-corrie-actress.jpg','Kimberley Gail \"Kym\" Marsh is an English actress and former singer-songwriter, who rose to fame in 2001 after winning a place in the band Hear\'Say, as a result of appearing on the reality television series Popstars.','Actress & Singer','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@msm4rsh',''),(662,'michael-parkinson-tv-personality-broadcaster','Michael Parkinson','michael-parkinson-tv-personality.jpg','Sir Michael Parkinson was one of Britainâ€™s most iconic broadcasters â€” a journalist, author, and the legendary host of Parkinson, which ran from 1971â€“1982 and again from 1998â€“2007. Renowned for his thoughtful, revealing interviews, he is widely regarded as the UKâ€™s greatest talk-show host, creating some of televisionâ€™s most memorable moments. Beyond TV, he wrote childrenâ€™s books and several autobiographies, cementing his status as a true British media great.','Broadcaster','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','','Yes'),(663,'sylvester-mc-coy-actor','Sylvester McCoy','sylvester-mc-coy-actor.jpg','Sylvester McCoy is a Scottish actor best known for playing the Seventh Doctor in Doctor Who from 1987 to 1989, becoming the final Doctor of the showâ€™s original run before briefly returning in the 1996 TV film. After Doctor Who, he built a strong stage career and appeared in major films including The Hobbit trilogy and Pirates of the Caribbean. He also starred alongside Robert Picardo in the acclaimed stage production A Joke.','Actor','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@4SylvesterMcCoy',''),(664,'shayne-ward-singer-actor','Shayne Ward','shayne-ward-singer-actor.jpg','Shayne Thomas Ward is an English singer and actor. He is best known for his role as Aidan Connor in Coronation Street from 2015 to 2018. He rose to fame as the winner of the second series of The X Factor.','Actor','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@shayneTward',''),(665,'sean-bean-actor','Sean Bean','sean-bean-actor.jpg','Sean Bean, is an English actor and one of the biggest starts of his generation. He was born and grew up in Sheffield before attending and graduating from the Royal Academy of Dramatic Art. He became a global star for his role as Richard Sharpe in the ITV show \'Sharpe\' and he was famous for his portrayal of Boromir in 2001\'s The Lord of the Rings and for playing Ned Stark in the hit HBO show \'Game of Thrones\'.','Actor','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@SeanBeanOnline','Yes'),(666,'robert-powell-actor','Robert Powell','robert-powell-actor.jpg','Robert Powell is an English film and television actor best known for his acclaimed portrayal of Jesus in Jesus of Nazareth, a role that brought him international recognition. He is also widely recognised for playing the fictional spy Richard Hannay in various adaptations. Across a career spanning decades, Robert has delivered compelling performances in drama and action alike, cementing his reputation as one of British television and cinemaâ€™s most respected and enduring talents.','Television actor','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','',''),(667,'ralf-little-actor','Ralf Little','ralf-little-actor.jpg','Ralf Little is an English actor most famous for his role as Antony in The Royal family and Jonny Keogh in Tow Pints of Lager and a packet Crisps. Many people don\'t know, however, that Little is also a writer and a semi-professional footballer. Little has also acted in several films, including 24 Hour Party People, AI\'s Lads, and The Waiting Room. In 2018, Little was in a production God in Carnage at Bath\'s Theatre Royal.','Actor','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@RalfLittle',''),(668,'mark-addy-actor','Mark Addy','mark-addy-actor.jpg','ðŸŽ­ Mark Addy is a British actor celebrated for his versatile roles across film, television, and theatre. ðŸŒŸ He gained international fame for portraying the lovable Robert Baratheon in Game of Thrones. With his natural charm and acting talent, Mark has also starred in iconic films like The Full Monty, A Knightâ€™s Tale, and Robin Hood. ðŸŽ¬ Whether in comedy, drama, or fantasy, his performances continue to captivate audiences worldwide. ','Actor','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>     ','@conventionagcy','Yes'),(669,'jennifer-gibney-mrs-browns-boys-actress','Jennifer Gibney','jennifer-gibney-mrs-browns-boys-actress.jpg','Jennifer Gibney is an Irish actress, best known for playing Cathy Brown in the BBC television sitcom, <a href=\"http://mrsbrownsboys.com/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Mrs. Brown\'s Boys\">Mrs. Brown\'s Boys</a>. Gibney appears in Mrs. Brown\'s Boys as the daughter of Agnes Brown, played by her real-life husband, Brendan O\'Carroll.','Irish actress','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@JennyGibney',''),(670,'jennie-mcalpine-actress','Jennie McAlpine','jennie-mcalpine-actress.jpg','Jennie Elizabeth McAlpine is a British television actress, comedian and businesswoman. She is best known for her role as Fiz Brown in the soap opera Coronation Street. She also took part in season 17 of I\'m a Celebrity...Get Me Out of Here! in 2017, where she came in fourth place.','British television actress','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>','@jenniemcalpine',''),(671,'jack-whitehall-actor-comedian','Jack Whitehall','jack-whitehall-actor-comedian.jpg','Jack Whitehall is a British comedian, TV presenter, and actor. Whitehall is perhaps best known for his stand up comedy or for starring in the TV series Fresh Meat, or for playing Alfie Wickers in the TV series Bad Education. Jack Whitehall also created a fun television show for Netflix where he travels around with his father, Michael and also appears in major motion pictures including Disney\'s Jungle Cruise.\r\n','Actor & Comedian','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>            ','@jackwhitehall','Yes'),(672,'andrew-dunn-actor','Andrew Dunn','andrew-dunn-actor.jpg','Andrew Dunn is an English actor who made a name for himself as Tony in the BBC sitcom Dinnerladies, between 1998 and 2000. Dunn then went on to play the role of Roger Stiles in Coronation Street from 2007 to 2008.  Dunn also performed in the show Doctors and in a touring production of The Full Monty.','Actor','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@TheMrAndrewDunn',''),(673,'danny-dyer-actor-hardman','Danny Dyer','danny-dyer-actor-hardman.jpg','Daniel John Dyer, better known as Danny Dyer, is an English actor famous for his tough but lovable cockney characters. Danny dyer has worked in television, film, and theatre and he made his breaktrhough as Moff in Human Traffic. He is also well-known as Billy the Limpet in Mean Machine, and Tommy Johnson in The Football Factory. ','Actor','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@MrDDyer','Yes'),(674,'dean-gaffney-actor','Dean Gaffney','dean-gaffney-actor.jpg','Dean Martin Gaffney is an English actor. He is best known for his role as Robbie Jackson on the BBC soap opera EastEnders from 1993 to 2003 and again full-time from 2017, he however made guest appearances in the soap in 2004, 2010 and 2015, and has also appeared in various reality television shows such as I\'m a Celebrity...Get Me Out of Here','Actor','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>','@deangaffney1',''),(675,'chris-chittell-emmerdale-actor','Chris Chittell','chris-chittell-emmerdale-actor.jpg','Christopher John Chittell is an English actor, best known for his role as Eric Pollard in ITV\'s Emmerdale, a part that he has played since 1986. and is now the longest serving character having played Pollard for 32 years. ','Actor','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>','@ChrisChittell',''),(676,'ian-reddington-eastenders-actor','Ian Reddington','ian-reddington-eastenders-actor.jpg','Ian Reddington is an English actor with many stage and television credits since the early 1980s. He became widely known for television roles such as the Chief Clown in the Doctor Who serial The Greatest Show in the Galaxy, Richard Cole in EastEnders and Vernon Tomlin in Coronation Street. ','Actor','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>','@Reddington_Ian',''),(677,'colin-Baker-actor-dr-who','Colin Baker','colin-Baker-actor-dr-who.jpg','Colin Baker is an English actor. He became known for playing Paul Merroney in the BBC drama series The Brothers from 1974 to 1976. He later played the sixth incarnation of the Doctor in the long-running science fiction television series Doctor Who from 1984 to 1986.\r\n','Actor','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>','@SawbonesHex',''),(678,'dr-who-dalek','Dalek','dr-who-dalek.jpg','The Daleks are a fictional extraterrestrial race of mutants principally portrayed in the British science fiction television programme Doctor Who. The Daleks were conceived by science-fiction writer Terry Nation and first appeared in the 1963 Doctor Who serial The Daleks, in the shells designed by Raymond Cusick.','Mechanical Actor','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>','@thedaleks',''),(679,'tim-brooke-taylor-comedian','Tim Brooke-Taylor','tim-brooke-taylor-comedian.jpg','Timothy Julian Brooke-Taylor OBE is an English comic actor. He became active in performing in comedy sketches while at Cambridge University, and became President of the Footlights club, touring internationally with the Footlights revue in 1964.','Comic','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>','@TimBrookeTaylor',''),(680,'barry-cryer-comedian','Barry Cryer','barry-cryer-comedian.jpg','Barry Charles Cryer, OBE is an English writer, comedian and actor. Cryer has written for many performers, including Dave Allen, Stanley Baxter, Rory Bremner, George Burns, Jasper Carrott, Tommy Cooper, Les Dawson, Kenny Everett, Bruce Forsyth, Richard Pryor, Spike Milligan, Mike Yarwood, The Two Ronnies and Morecambe and Wise.','Writer','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@barrycryer80',''),(681,'sean-hughes-comedian','Sean Hughes','sean-hughes-comedian.jpg','Sean Hughes was an English-born Irish stand-up comedian. He was also a writer and actor. Hughes starred in his own Channel 4 television show \'Sean\'s Show\' and was a regular team captain on \'Never Mind the Buzzcocks\'. Hughes said he got into comedy because sounding English in an Irish show meant that he was often picked on, but making people laugh was a great way to win people over. Hughes was a great comedy talent and he is sadly no longer with us.','Comedian','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@mr_seanhughes',''),(682,'paul-heaton-singer-beautiful-south','Paul Heaton','paul-heaton-singer-beautiful-south.jpg','Paul David Heaton is an English singer-songwriter of The Beautiful South. Heaton was a member of The Housemartins, who had success with the singles \"Happy Hour\" and the number-one \"Caravan of Love\" in 1986 before disbanding in 1988.','Singer & Songwriter','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@PaulHeatonSolo',''),(683,'jacqui-abbot-beautiful-south-singer','Jacqui Abbot','jacqui-abbot-beautiful-south-singer.jpg','Jacqueline \"Jacqui\" Abbott is a British singer who was the female vocalist with the band The Beautiful South from 1994 to 2000, following the departure of Briana Corrigan. With Abbott, the band released several Top 10 singles. \r\n','Singer','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@PaulHeatonSolo',''),(684,'bill-bailey-comedian','Bill Bailey','bill-bailey-comedian.jpg','Bill Bailey is a much-loved English comedian who combines a quirky sense of humour with exceptional musicianship. Bill is also an actor, making his big TV break on the hit show Black Books. Bill Bailey regularly tours the UK and is also famous for being one of the team captains on the BBC\'s Never Mind the Buzzcocks music quiz show. Bill has also appeared regularly on Have I Got News for You and QI. ','Comedian','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@BillBailey','Yes'),(685,'billy-pearce-comedian','Billy Pearce','billy-pearce-comedian.jpg','Billy Pearce is an award-winning English performer, comedian, actor and entertainer. A regular on UK television in the 1980s and 1990s, Pearce has been described as a \"supreme entertainer\". He particularly loves performing at the Alhambra Theatre in Bradford, where he consistently breaks box office records ','Comedian & Performer','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>','@1BillyPearce',''),(686,'bobby-davro-comedian','Bobby Davro','bobby-davro-comedian.jpg','Bobby Davro is an English comedian and actor who initially made a name for himself in 1983 on the show Live from Her Majesty\'s. He then followed this up with appearances on the hit TV show Copy Cats. Davro has been on EastEnders, Dancing on Ice, Your Face Sounds Familiar, and various pantomines over the decades. Davro is a talented actor and an accomplished impressionst.','Actor & Comedian','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@BobbyDavro1',''),(687,'brian-conley-comedian','Brian Conley','brian-conley-comedian.jpg','Brian Paul Conley is an English comedian, television presenter, singer and actor. As a presenter he is arguably best known as the host of The Brian Conley Show, as well as presenting the Royal Variety Performance on eight occasions.','Comedian','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@RealBrianConley',''),(688,'chris-ramsey-comedian','Chris Ramsey','chris-ramsey-comedian.jpg','Chris Ramsey is a comedian from South Shields in the North East of England. Ramsey\'s rise to fame wasn\'t short-lived, however, as he has continued to work in TV over the years. in 2017, Ramsey took over as host on Stand Up Central, replacing Russell Howard.','Comedian','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@IAmChrisRamsey',''),(689,'freddie-parrot-face-davies-comedian','Freddie \'Parrot Face\' Davies','freddie-parrot-face-davies-comedian.jpg','Freddie Davies is a British comedian and actor who achieved fame in 1964 via the television programme Opportunity Knocks and has since appeared in several television series and films.','Comedian','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@mrparrotface',''),(691,'jasper-carrott-comedian','Jasper Carrott','jasper-carrott-comedian.jpg','Jasper Carrott is an English comedian, actor and television presenter from Birmingham, celebrated for his long and successful career in British entertainment. He earned a place on the Birmingham Walk of Stars, an honour he shares with Ozzy Osbourne. Among his many shows, one of his most popular was Carrottâ€™s Commercial Breakdown, where he showcased and gently mocked peculiar TV adverts from around the world. His sharp humour and warm delivery have made him a much-loved comedy figure.','Comedian','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@carrottofficial','Yes'),(692,'jimmy-tarbuck-presenter-funnyman','Jimmy Tarbuck','jimmy-tarbuck-presenter-funnyman.jpg','James â€œJimmyâ€ Tarbuck is an English comedian best known for hosting Sunday Night at the London Palladium in the mid-1960s, a role that made him one of Britainâ€™s most recognisable entertainers. He later fronted a wide range of ITV quiz shows throughout the 70s, 80s and 90s, including Winner Takes All, Tarbyâ€™s Frame Game and Full Swing. Tarbuck was also a regular choice to host major British variety shows such as Live from the Palladium and Live from Her Majestyâ€™s.','Comedian','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','',''),(695,'phill-jupitus-comedian','Phill Jupitus','phill-jupitus-comedian.jpg','Phill Jupitus is an English stand-up comedian and improv master. He has done many stand=up tours of the UK, but he is perhaps best known as one of hte team captains on BBC 2\'s Never Mind the Buzzcocks. Jupitus is also an actor, performance poet, cartoonist and podcaster. Much of his work today in on the radio and working on podcasts.','Comedian','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@jupitusphillip',''),(696,'richard-herring-comedian','Richard Herring','richard-herring-comedian.jpg','Richard Herring is a stand-up comedian from Yorkshire. He is also an accomplished comedy writer. Early in his career, Herring was known as one half of the comedy double act Lee and Herring. The British Theatre Guide describes him as \"one of the leading hidden masters of modern British comedy\".','Comedian','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@Herring1967',''),(697,'rob-walker-bbc-sport','Rob Walker','rob-walker-bbc-sport.jpg','Robert Joseph \"Rob\" Walker is a British sports commentator, television presenter and freelance reporter, who has covered sports including tennis, snooker, darts, boxing, football, sailing and athletics for the BBC, Channel 4, ITV, Setanta Sports and the IAAF.','Sports commentator','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>','@robwalkertv',''),(699,'jason-mohammed-bbc-sport','Jason Mohammad','jason-mohammed-bbc-sport.jpg','Jason Mohammad is a Welsh radio and television presenter currently working for the BBC. He is the current host of Final Score on BBC One on Saturday afternoons.','Radio presenter','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@jasonmohammad',''),(700,'helen-skelton-blue-peter-tv-presenter','Helen Skelton','helen-skelton-blue-peter-tv-presenter.jpg','Helen Skelton is an English television presenter known for co-presenting Blue Peter from 2008 until 2013. Once her time at Blue Peter was over, Skelton became a presenter on Countryfile. She also served as co-presenter on  Holiday Hit Squad. Skelton is also the presentor for The Instant Gardener. Originally from Appleby, Helen Skelton was brought up on a dairy farm and she first graced the UK\'s televisions as an extra on Coronation Street.','Television presenter','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@HelenSkelton',''),(701,'david-dimbleby-bbc-television','David Dimbleby','david-dimbleby-bbc-television.jpg','David Dimbleby is a widely respected British journalist and television presenter, best known for hosting the BBCâ€™s flagship political debate programme Question Time. Renowned for his sharp, steady moderation, he guided live discussions between politicians, journalists, celebrities and the public, keeping debates focused and on track. Dimbleby spent decades presenting major current affairs and political broadcasts for the BBC. In 2018, he stepped down from Question Time, with Fiona Bruce succeeding him.','British journalist','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@daviddimble','Yes'),(702,'dick-and-dom-tv-radio-personalities','Dick and Dom','dick-and-dom-tv-radio-personalities.jpg','Dick and Dom\'s real names are Richard McCourt and Dominic Wood. A British comedy duo famous for presenting various show, especially on CBBC. While Dick and Dom may have made a name for themselves in the 90s, they have continued to work over the last two decades.','TV Legends','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@dickndom',''),(703,'terry-giffiths-snooker-player','Terry Griffiths','terry-giffiths-snooker-player.jpg','Terrence \"Terry\" Griffiths, OBE is a retired Welsh snooker player and current snooker coach and pundit. He won the World Championship in 1979 at the first attempt, and reached the 1988 final. ','Snooker player','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>','@TGSnooker',''),(704,'captain-sensible-singer','Captain Sensible','captain-sensible-singer.jpg','Raymond Ian Burns, known by the stage name Captain Sensible, is an English singer, songwriter and guitarist. Sensible co-founded the punk rock band The Damned, originally playing bass before switching to guitar.','Singer','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>','@sensiblecaptain',''),(705,'hazel-irvine-tv-presenter','Hazel Irvine','hazel-irvine-tv-presenter.jpg','Hazel Irvine, is a Scottish television presenter. She began her broadcasting career in radio, before moving to work for Scottish Television in 1988 as a continuity announcer and latterly, as a sports reporter-presenter. This led to slots on the national ITV network co-presenting coverage of the 1988 Olympics alongside Dickie Davies, and presenting reports from the Scotland football team\'s training camp at the 1990 World Cup.','Television presenter','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','','Yes'),(706,'dixie-heart-yorkshire','David Dixon','dixie-heart-yorkshire.jpg','David Dixon is a popular radio presenter on Heart Yorkshire, known for his friendly voice and engaging style that keeps listeners entertained across the region. A trusted name on the airwaves, Davidâ€™s passion for music and connection with his audience have made him a favourite among Heart listeners. ','Radio Presenter','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>      ','@dixieonline',''),(707,'dan-wootton-itv-showbiz','Dan Wootton','dan-wootton-itv-showbiz.jpg','Dan Wootton is a New Zealand-born journalist and broadcaster. In 2013, he joined The Sun on Sunday and became editor of the Bizarre column the following year. In February 2016, he became associate editor of The Sun and in March 2018 was promoted to executive editor.','New Zealand journalist','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>     ','@danwootton','Yes'),(708,'jonathan-dimbleby-tv-host','Jonathan Dimbleby','jonathan-dimbleby-tv-host.jpg','Jonathan Dimbleby is a British presenter of current affairs and political radio and television programmes, an author and historian. He is the son of Richard Dimbleby and younger brother of British TV presenter David Dimbleby. ','British presenter','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>','@dimbleby_jd',''),(709,'keith-chegwin-legend-tv-personality','Keith Chegwin','keith-chegwin-legend-tv-personality.jpg','Keith Chegwin was an English television presenter and actor. Chegwin appeared in manyl children\'s shows in the 70s and 80s, including Cheggers Plays Pop and Multi-Coloured Swap Shop.  Early in Keith Chegwin\'s career, he performed in various West End shows, including Tom Brown\'s School Days and Captain Pugwash. Chegwin was a member of the Big Brother House in 2015.','Television presenter','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@keithchegwin',''),(710,'mark-labbett-the-chase','Mark Labbett','mark-labbett-the-chase.jpg','Mark Labbett is a British quiz champion and television personality best known as â€œThe Beastâ€ on ITVâ€™s The Chase. Joining the show in 2009, he quickly became a fan favourite thanks to his formidable knowledge and commanding on-screen presence. His success led to appearances on both the US and Australian versions, where he continues to impress with his quizzing skill. Labbettâ€™s towering persona and sharp intellect have made him one of the most recognisable Chasers worldwide.','(The Beast)','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@MarkLabbett',''),(711,'patrick-keilty-comedian-tv-personality','Patrick Kielty','patrick-kielty-comedian-tv-personality.jpg','Patrick Kielty, often known as Paddy Kielty, is a Northern Irish comedian and television presenter from Dundrum. He first gained attention at school for his sharp impersonations of local politicians and celebrities, quickly realising comedy came naturally to him. He began his TV career on UTVâ€™s SUS in 1993 before hosting his own chat show, PK Tonight. Kielty later fronted bigger BBC programmes, including Last Chance Lottery and Patrick Kielty Almost Live, cementing his place in UK entertainment.','Comedian','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@PatricKielty',''),(712,'mike-bushell-presenter','Mike Bushell','mike-bushell-presenter.jpg','Mike Bushell is a sports presenter for the BBC. He presents the sport on BBC Breakfast on Fridays and at the weekends, and sometimes on other weekdays. ','Sports presenter','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>','@mikebreakfast',''),(714,'aled-jones-tv-personality','Aled Jones','aled-jones-tv-personality.jpg','Aled Jones, MBE, is a Welsh singer originally famous for his performance of the cover of \'Walking in the Air\' when he was a teenager. Since then, Aled continued to sing and to present radio and television shows. Aled has worked on \'Songs of Praise\', Escape to the Country\', \'The One Show\', and many others. he has also for his musical theatre performances in White Christmas, Chitty Chitty Bang Bang, and Joseph and the Amazing echnicolour Dreamcoat.','Singer & TV Presenter','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@realaled','Yes'),(715,'astro-ub40-singer','Astro','astro-ub40-singer.jpg','You might not know the name Terence Wilson, but you probably do know his stage name: Astro. Astro is a musical legend; he is a British musician and rapper who made a name for himself as part of UB40 from 1979 until he left the in November 2013. Astro has continued to be part of the British music scene, despite his departure from UB40.','Musician','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@Ali_Astro_',''),(718,'ali-campbell-ub40-singer','Ali Campbell','ali-campbell-ub40-singer.jpg','Alistair Ian Campbell is an English musician and the lead singer and founding member of UB40.  UB40, with Campbell as the frontman, sold 70 million+ records worldwide and gave world tours for 30 years. In 2008, Campbell left UB40 and started his solo career. In 2012, Campbell was a judge on New Zealand\'s Got Talent and in 2014, Campbell reunited with his ex-bandmates, reforming UB40.','Singer','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>     ','@UB40',''),(719,'antony-costa-blue-singer','Antony Costa','antony-costa-blue-singer.jpg','Antony Costa is an English singer-songwriter famous for his role in the boy band Blue. Costa also acts and was part of a Blood Brothers production in London n 2007 Antoy has also acted in Casualty, Chaulk, and Grange Hill (when he was a boy). Whle Blue  isn\'t active anymore, Costa enjoys a thriving a career.','Singer','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@AntonyCosta',''),(720,'bev-beven-elo-singer','Bev Bevan','bev-beven-elo-singer.jpg','Beverley Bevan is an English rock musician, who was the drummer and one of the original members of The Move and Electric Light Orchestra. After the end of ELO in 1986, he founded ELO Part II.','Musician','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>','@BevBevanELO',''),(722,'billy-ocean-singer-songwriter','Billy Ocean','billy-ocean-singer-songwriter.jpg','Billy Ocean is a musical legend of Trinidadian-English decent. Billy Ocean had several R&B/pop hits in the 70s and 80s, his fame reaching around the world. Ocean was, arguably, the most popular British R&B singer-songwriter of the mid-1980s. Ocean has won many awards and he last released an album in 2017.\r\n','Singer & Songwriter','  <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>       ','@MrWongo','Yes'),(723,'chas-and-dave-musicians','Chas & Dave','chas-and-dave-musicians.jpg','Chas & Dave were an English pop rock duo, formed in London by Chas Hodges and Dave Peacock. They were most notable as creators and performers of a musical style labelled rockney, which mixes \"pub singalong, music-hall humour, boogie-woogie piano and pre-Beatles rock \'n\' roll\".','Pop duo','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>','@chas_dave',''),(724,'dane-bowers-singer','Dane Bowers','dane-bowers-singer.jpg','Dane Leon Bowers is an English singer, songwriter, DJ and record producer. He was a part of R&B boyband Another Level between 1997 and 2000 when he performed on seven Top 10 singles, before taking up solo projects with True Steppers and Victoria Beckham','Singer','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>','@danebowers',''),(725,'faye-tozer-singer','Faye Tozer','faye-tozer-singer.jpg','Faye Louise Tozer is an English singer-songwriter, dancer and stage actress, famous for being one of the three female co-lead singers of British pop group Steps. ','Singer & Songwriter','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@Faye_Tozer',''),(726,'huey-morgan-fyc-singer','Huey Morgan','huey-morgan-fyc-singer.jpg','Huey Morgan is an American musician best known as the frontman of rock/hip hop band Fun Lovin\' Criminals. Morgan performs both vocals and guitar and combines rock, hip hop, jazz, reggae, and funk influences in his music. He also performs as a BBC Radio DJ, and has made film and TV appearances. ','American musician','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>','@OfficialHuey',''),(727,'jive-bunny-dj-musician','Jive Bunny','jive-bunny-dj-musician.jpg','Jive Bunny and the Mastermixers were a 1980s and 1990s novelty pop music act from Rotherham, Yorkshire, England. The face of the group was Jive Bunny, a cartoon rabbit who appeared in the videos, and also did promotional appearances for them.','Pop group','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>','@jive_bunny',''),(728,'lulu-singer','Lulu','lulu-singer.jpg',' Lulu Kennedy-Cairns is a renowned Scottish singer-songwriter, famous for her iconic songs in James Bond films, including The Man with the Golden Gun (1974) and To Sir with Love (1967).  In the UK, sheâ€™s cherished for her hit Shout, performed at the 2014 Commonwealth Games in Glasgow. ðŸŽ¤ Lulu continues to captivate audiences through her appearances on television shows, including the 2017 episode of Who Do You Think You Are. ','Singer','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@lulushouts','Yes'),(729,'martin-and-gary-kemp','Martin Kemp','martin-and-gary-kemp.jpg','Martin Kemp is an English actor, director and musician, famous as the bassist for Spandau Ballet during their 1980s heyday and for his memorable role as Steve Owen in EastEnders. The younger brother of bandmate Gary Kemp, Martin has enjoyed a wide-ranging career on screen and stage. His theatre work includes playing the Childcatcher in Chitty Chitty Bang Bang (2016) and Captain Hook in Peter Pan (2017), showcasing his versatility as a performer.','Actor & Singer','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>    ','@realmartinkemp','Yes'),(730,'stephen-hendry-snooker-player','Stephen Hendry','stephen-hendry-snooker-player.jpg','Stephen Gordon Hendry MBE is a Scottish former professional snooker player and current commentator for the BBC and ITV. ','Snooker player','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>','@SHendry775',''),(731,'sue-perkins-tv-presenter','Sue Perkins','sue-perkins-tv-presenter.jpg','ue Perkins is an English comedian, broadcaster, actress and writer who first found fame as half of the comedy duo Mel and Sue. She later became a household name co-presenting The Great British Bake Off for six years during its BBC run. Sue has fronted numerous documentaries and history-focused programmes, and appeared on shows including Newsnight with Sir Trevor McDonald, Celebrity Poker, and Celebrity MasterChef. Her wit, warmth and versatility have made her a staple of British television.','Comedian','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@sueperkins','Yes'),(732,'roy-wood-singer-musician','Roy Wood','roy-wood-singer-musician.jpg','Roy Wood is an English singer-songwriter and multi-instrumentalist. He was particularly successful in the 1960s and 1970s as member and co-founder of the Move, Electric Light Orchestra and Wizzard. As a songwriter, he contributed a number of hits to the repertoire of these bands. ','Singer & Musician',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@DrRoyWood','Yes'),(734,'steve-mcclaren-ex-england-football-manager','Steve McClaren','steve-mcclaren-ex-england-football-manager.jpg','Stephen McClaren is an English professional football manager and former player who is currently manager of Queens Park Rangers. McClaren served as manager of the England national team from August 2006 to November 2007. He was sacked when England failed to qualify for UEFA Euro 2008.','Football manager',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>','@QPR',''),(735,'bruno-tonioli-dancer','Bruno Tonioli','bruno-tonioli-dancer.jpg','Bruno Tonioli is an Italian choreographer, dancer, and TV personality. He appears as a judge on the British television dance competition Strictly Come Dancing and its American adaptation Dancing with the Stars on ABC TV in the US.','Choreographer & Dancer',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@BrunoTonioli','Yes'),(736,'shirley-ballas-dancer','Shirley Ballas','shirley-ballas-dancer.jpg','Shirley Ballas is an English ballroom dancer, dance teacher, and dance adjudicator from Wallasey who specialises in the International Latin division, where she won several championship titles which earned her the nickname The Queen of Latin','Dancer',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@ShirleyBallas','Yes'),(737,'dame-darcey-bussell-dancer','Darcey Bussell','dame-darcey-bussell-dancer.jpg','Dame Darcey Bussell DBE is one of Britainâ€™s most beloved ballerinas, celebrated for her distinguished career with The Royal Ballet before retiring from the stage. Since then, she has become widely known as a warm and enthusiastic judge on Strictly Come Dancing, offering encouragement and expert guidance to contestants. Darcey has also authored numerous books, including the popular Magic Ballerina childrenâ€™s series, continuing to inspire young dancers and readers alike.','Ballerina & Presenter',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@DarceyOfficial',''),(738,'ore-oduba-tv-radio-personality','Ore Oduba','ore-oduba-tv-radio-personality.jpg','Ore Oduba is a British television and radio presenter, best known for winning the fourteenth series of BBC One\'s Strictly Come Dancing. He presented the BBC children\'s news programme Newsround from 2008 until 2013. In 2018 he hosted the game show And They\'re Off! in aid of Sport Relief.','British television presenter',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>','@OreOduba',''),(739,'doctor-ranj-tv-personality','Doctor Ranj Singh','doctor-ranj-tv-personality.jpg','Ranjit \"Ranj\" Singh is a British doctor, television presenter, author and columnist. He is best known for co-creating and presenting the CBeebies show Get Well Soon from 2012 to 2015. He also appears on ITV This Morning, as a resident doctor, as well as co-hosting ITV Save Money: Good Health alongside Sian Williams. ','Television presenter',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@DrRanj','Yes'),(740,'stacey-dooley-tv-presenter','Stacey Dooley','stacey-dooley-tv-presenter.jpg','Stacey Dooley MBE is a British television presenter, journalist and author known for her hard-hitting BBC Three documentaries exploring social issues, child labour, and the experiences of women in developing countries. Her fearless, empathetic reporting has made her one of the UKâ€™s most recognised documentary voices. In 2018, Stacey won Strictly Come Dancing and is now in a relationship with her former dance partner, Kevin Clifton. Her work continues to highlight important global stories with clarity and compassion.','Television presenter',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@StaceyDooley','Yes'),(741,'lauren-steadman-paralympic-athlete','Lauren Steadman','lauren-steadman-paralympic-athlete.jpg','Lauren Steadman is a British Paralympic athlete who has competed in three Summer Paralympics, in both swimming and the paratriathlon.','Athlete',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>','@LaurenSteadman',''),(742,'everal-a-walsh','Everal A Walsh','everal-a-walsh-actor.jpg','Everal A. Walsh is a British actor. Working at the National Theatre including Amadeus on television and film including 2019 Movie The Favourite alongside Olivia Coleman and Emma Stone.','Actor','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@EveralWalsh',''),(743,'dave-goreman-comedian','Dave Gorman','dave-goreman-comedian.jpg','Dave Gorman is an English comedian, TV presenter and author known for his quirky, off-beat humour and inventive storytelling. He began his career writing for shows such as The Mrs Merton Show and The Fast Show, before earning acclaim as a stand-up, including a Perrier Award nomination. Gorman became widely known for his hit series Are You Dave Gorman?, Dave Gormanâ€™s Important Astrology Experiment and Googlewhack Adventure, securing his place as a uniquely imaginative voice in British comedy.','Comedian',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@DaveGorman','Yes'),(744,'john-culshaw-impressionist','Jon Culshaw','john-culshaw-impressionist.jpg','Jon Culshaw is an English impressionist and comedian. Culshaw is most famous for his work on the radio comedy Dead Ringers, but he has had many other successful shows, including 2DTV, The Impressions Show, Newzoids, and several performances on Spitting Image. Culshaw\'s first television performance was in an ITV show called Alter Ego where he interviewed male celebrities while doing an impression of them.','Impressionist',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>    ','@jonculshaw','Yes'),(745,'gwyneth-strong-actress','Gwyneth Strong','gwyneth-strong-actress.jpg','Gwyneth Strong is an English actress. She is best known for her role in the BBC sitcom Only Fools and Horses as Cassandra, the love interest and, later, wife of Rodney.','English actress',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@gwynethstrong18',''),(746,'ben-adams-a1-singer','Ben Adams','ben-adams-a1-singer.jpg','Benjamin Edward Stephen Adams is an English singer and songwriter, best known as a member of the boy band a1\r\n','Singer',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@benadamsuk',''),(747,'dara-o-briain-comedian-presenter','Dara O Briain','dara-o-briain-comedian-presenter.jpg','Dara O Briain is an Irish comedian and TV presenter who mostly works in the UK but also sometimes works in Ireland. Dara O Briain is perhaps most famous for his role as host on TV\'s Mock the Week, but his various stand-up tours and DVDs have all sold well. O Briain is also known for hosting The Panel and The Apprentice: You\'re Fired!','Comedian',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>     ','@daraobriain','Yes'),(748,'howard-middeton-great-british-bake-off','Howard Middleton','howard-middeton-great-british-bake-off.jpg','Howard Middleton is an amateur chef and baker from Sheffield, Yorkshire, United Kingdom. Howard was a contestant on The Great British Bake Off Season 4 where he left on episode 6. ','Chef',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@HowardMiddlebun',''),(749,'sugarbabes-band-member-amelle-berrabah','Amelle Berrabah','sugarbabes-band-member-amelle-berrabah.jpg','Amelle Berrabah is an English singer who first made a name for herself as a member of the Sugababes by replacing founding member Mutya Buena in December 2005. Berrabah also enjoyed some solo success on a collaboration with Tinchy Stryder in 2009 with \'Never Leave You\'.  In 2016, Berrabah took part in Celebrity Masterchef.','Singer & Songwriter',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>    ','@Amelle_B_SRosa',''),(750,'neil-mcdermott-eastenders-actor','Neil McDermott','neil-mcdermott-eastenders-actor.jpg','Neil McDermott is a British stage and television actor, who is best known for portraying Ryan Malloy in the BBC television soap opera EastEnders.','British television actor',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@NeilMcDermott07',''),(751,'joe-mcelderry-singer-performer','Joe McElderry','joe-mcelderry-singer-performer.jpg','Joseph McElderry is an English singer and songwriter. He won the sixth series of the ITV show The X Factor in 2009. His first single \"The Climb\" reached number one on both the UK Singles Chart and the Irish Singles Charts.','Singer & Songwriter',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@joemcelderry91',''),(752,'hairy-bikers-presenters-chefs','Hairy Bikers','hairy-bikers-presenters-chefs.jpg','The Hairy Bikers, made up of David Myers and Simon â€œSiâ€ King, are one of the UKâ€™s most beloved food-presenting duos. Though known for their motorbikes, theyâ€™re celebrated not as professional chefs but as passionate home cooks and enthusiastic travellers. Their hit series follow them riding across the UK and around the world, discovering local dishes and sharing accessible, flavour-packed recipes. Their warmth, humour and love of good food have made them household favourites.','British television presenters',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>     ','@HairyBikers','Yes'),(753,'roy-hudd-comedian','Roy Hudd','roy-hudd-comedian.jpg','ðŸŽ­ Roy Hudd, OBE, is a celebrated English comedian, actor, presenter, radio host, author, and expert on the history of music hall entertainment. ðŸŒŸ With a career spanning decades, Roy has brought joy to audiences through his sharp wit and deep knowledge of British comedy and theatre. ðŸŽ¤ As a radio host and author, Roy has contributed greatly to preserving the legacy of music hall. ','Comedian',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','',''),(754,'fiona-bruce-tv-presenter','Fiona Bruce','fiona-bruce-tv-presenter.jpg','Fiona Bruce is a British journalist and newsreader. Bruce first joined the BBC in 1989 with the show Panorama and she then went on to become the News at Ten\'s first female news reader. Fiona Bruce is a British news icon, but her career spanned beyond the news, with shows like Antiques Roadshow, Fake or Fortune, and her recent appointion as the presenter of Question Time, taking over from David Dimbleby.','Journalist',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','',''),(755,'heather-small-singer','Heather Small','heather-small-singer.jpg','Heather Small, is an English soul singer, who grew up on a West London council estate. She is best known for being the lead singer in the band M People. Her debut solo album was Proud, which was released in 2000. She was also a contestant in the British television show Strictly Come Dancing in 2008.','Singer',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@MPeopleHeatherS',''),(756,'bradley-mcIntosh-singer','Bradley McIntosh','bradley-mcIntosh-singer.jpg','Bradley John McIntosh, also known as City Boy, is an English-Jamaican singer, rapper, record producer and former actor. He was a member of the pop group S Club where he enjoyed five years of hit singles, arena tours and awards. 2008-2015 he was member of spin-off group S Club 3.','Singer',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@BradleyMcIntosh',''),(757,'sam-lavery-x-factor-singer','Sam Lavery','sam-lavery-x-factor-singer.jpg','Samantha Jayne \"Sam\" Lavery is an English singer from Durham who competed in Series 13 of The X Factor as part of the Girls category mentored by Simon Cowell. She was originally eliminated at the Six Chair Challenge but chosen by Louis Walsh as a wildcard.','Singer',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@SamLavery_',''),(758,'luke-friend-x-factor-singer','Luke Friend','luke-friend-x-factor-singer.jpg','Luke Friend is an English singer and former student from Teignmouth in Devon. He started his career in 2013 after winning TeenStar and appearing as a contestant and later a finalist on tenth series of The X Factor and later placed third on the show. ','Singer',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@LukeFriendMusic',''),(759,'tom-milner-actor','Tom Milner','tom-milner-actor.jpg','Although singing is his first love, Tom is best known for playing Paul Langley in â€˜Waterloo Roadâ€™ and has also appeared in Holby City, too. Alongside acting and singing heâ€™s a massive Bradford City FC fan and works as the warm-up guy at home matches.','English actor',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@tomkmilner',''),(760,'alfie-boe-singer-performer','Alfie Boe','alfie-boe-singer-performer.jpg','Alfie Boe (Alfred Giovanni Roncalli Boe) is an English tenor and actor, classically trained but best known for his powerful work in musical theatre. His standout role as Jean Valjean in Les MisÃ©rables at Londonâ€™s Queenâ€™s Theatre in 2010 earned widespread acclaim. Alfie has performed extensively in both the West End and Broadway, and has sold over one million albums in the UK, cementing his status as one of Britainâ€™s leading vocal talents.','Tenor',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>    ','@AlfieBoe','Yes'),(762,'denise-welsh-actress-presenter','Denise Welch','denise-welsh-actress-presenter.jpg','Jacqueline Denise Welch is an English actress and television presenter. She is known for her roles as Natalie Barnes in Coronation Street and Steph Haydock in Waterloo Road. She is also known for her appearances as a regular panellist on the ITV lunchtime chat show Loose Women from 2005 to 2013.','English actress',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@RealDeniseWelch',''),(763,'philip-lowrie-actor','Philip Lowrie','philip-lowrie-actor.jpg','Colin Philip Lowrie is a retired English television actor, best known for playing Dennis Tanner in the long-running ITV soap opera Coronation Street, from the programme\'s inception in 1960 until 1968, and again from 2011 until 2014.','Television actor',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','',''),(764,'ben-nealon-actor-obe','Ben Nealon','ben-nealon-actor-obe.jpg','Benjamin Nealon OBE is best known for playing 2nd Lt/Lt/Capt Jeremy Forsythe in the ITV award-winning series Soldier Soldier.','Television actor',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','',''),(765,'lorna-fitzgerald-actress','Lorna Fitzgerald','lorna-fitzgerald-actress.jpg','Lorna Katie Fitzgerald is a British actress from Northampton. Her most notable role to date is that of Abi Branning in the BBC soap opera EastEnders.','Actress',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@LornaFitz0',''),(766,'juliet-mills-actress','Juliet Mills','juliet-mills-actress.jpg','Juliet Maryon Mills is a British-American actress. She is the daughter of actor Sir John Mills and Mary Hayley Bell and the eldest of three siblings; her younger siblings are actress Hayley Mills and director Jonathan Mills.','British actress',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','',''),(767,'maxwell-caulfield-actor','Maxwell Caulfield','maxwell-caulfield-actor.jpg','Maxwell Caulfield is a British-American film, stage, and television actor and singer. He has appeared in films such as Grease 2, Electric Dreams, The Boys Next Door, The Supernaturals, Sundown: The Vampire in Retreat, Waxwork 2, Gettysburg, Empire Records, The Real Blonde, and The Man Who Knew Too Little.\r\n','American-British film actor',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@maxcaulfield',''),(768,'robert-duncan-actor','Robert Duncan','robert-duncan-actor.jpg','Robert Duncan is an English actor. He is best known for his television role as Gus Hedges, the jargon-speaking manager, from Drop the Dead Donkey. He also appeared in Casualty as Peter Hayes between 1995 and 1996. He also played Lazarus in 2000 film The Miracle Maker.','Actor',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@RdRobwelch',''),(769,'lesley-joseph-actress','Lesley Joseph','lesley-joseph-actress.jpg','Lesley Joseph is a celebrated English actress best known for playing the glamorous, sharp-tongued Dorien Green in Birds of a Feather, a role she starred in from 1989 to 1998 and again in the showâ€™s 2014â€“2017 revival. Beyond television, Lesley has enjoyed an extensive stage career, appearing in productions such as Absurd Person Singular, Calendar Girls, Thoroughly Modern Millie, Annie and Young Frankenstein. Her versatility and comic flair have made her a much-loved figure in British entertainment.','Actress',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>    ','@LesleyJosephTV',''),(770,'fern-britton-presenter','Fern Britton','fern-britton-presenter.jpg','Fern Britton is an English television presenter, but she is also a successful author. Britton first becamse famous for presenting Ready Steady Cook. Then Fern Britton went on to present This Morning. Most surprisingly, Britton made a complete career change in 2010 and she began to write and publish novels, short stories, and even some non-fiction. ','Television presenter',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@Fern_Britton',''),(771,'ian-mercer-actor','Ian Mercer','ian-mercer-actor.jpg','Ian Clive Mercer is an English actor. He is known for playing Gary Mallett in the ITV soap opera Coronation Street from 1995 to 2000, having previously appeared in 1987 as a different character. His other television credits include Brookside, Cracker, and The Street.','Actor',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','',''),(772,'lisa-maxwell-actress','Lisa Maxwell','lisa-maxwell-actress.jpg','Lisa Maxwell is an English actress and television presenter, best known for her roles in The Bill as Samantha Nixon, in EastEnders as Naomi and in Hollyoaks as Tracey Donavan.','Actress',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@thelisamaxwell',''),(773,'anna-jane-cassey-actress','Anna-Jane Casey','anna-jane-cassey-actress.jpg','Anna-Jane Casey is an English singer, dancer and actress best known for her work in musical theatre. ','English singer',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@AnnaJaneCasey',''),(774,'sarah-jane-buckley-actress','Sarah Jane Buckley','sarah-jane-buckley-actress.jpg','Sarah Jane Buckley is an actress and singer. She is also an ambassador for The Prince\'s Trust. She was well known for playing Kathy Barnes in Hollyoaks from November 2005 to January 2008 and again in April 2017 and September 2017.','Actress',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@SarahJaBuckley',''),(775,'sue-davaney-actress','Sue Devaney','sue-davaney-actress.jpg','Sue Devaney is an English actress. She is known for television roles in Coronation Street, Jonny Briggs, Casualty and Dinnerladies. Her extensive stage career includes roles in London productions of When We Are Married, The Wind in the Willows and The Land of the Living.','Actress',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','',''),(776,'rick-astley-singer-songwriter','Rick Astley','rick-astley-singer-songwriter.jpg','Rick Astley is a British singer best known for his global 1987 hit â€œNever Gonna Give You Up,â€ which topped charts in 25 countries and won the 1988 BRIT Award for Best British Single. The song later became a cultural phenomenon through the Rickrolling meme. By his initial retirement in 1993, Rick had sold around 40 million records worldwide. In 2008, he was voted Best Act Ever by MTV Europe Music','Singer & Songwriter',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>      ','@rickastley','Yes'),(777,'martin-fry-abc','Martin Fry','martin-fry-abc.jpg','Martin David Fry is an English singer, songwriter, composer, musician, and record producer. Fry\'s music career spans more than 30 years.','English singer',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@ABCFRY',''),(778,'michaela-tabb-snooker-ref','Michaela Tabb','michaela-tabb-snooker-ref.jpg','Michaela Tabb, born in 1967 in Bath, is a pioneering snooker and pool referee who became one of the most recognisable officials in cue sports. She began her career in pool, refereeing major events such as the WPA World Nine-ball Championship and the Mosconi Cup, before joining the World Snooker Tour in 2001. Michaela made history as the first woman to officiate a professional ranking snooker event (2002) and the first to referee the World Snooker Championship final (2009, 2012).','Association football referee',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@MichaelaTabb',''),(779,'kerry-katona-singer-actress','Kerry Katona','kerry-katona-singer-actress.jpg','Kerry Jayne Elizabeth Kay is an English singer and media personality. She was a member of girl group Atomic Kitten from 1998 until her first departure in 2001 and again from 2012 until her second departure in 2017. Her television work is predominantly in light entertainment and reality shows. ','Singer',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@KerryKatona7',''),(780,'lauren-platt-presenter','Lauren Platt','lauren-platt-presenter.jpg','Lauren Nicole Platt is an English singer, presenter and beauty vlogger who finished fourth in the eleventh series of The X Factor. From 2016 to 2018, she presented the CBBC children\'s talent show Got What It Takes?.','English singer',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@laurenplatt7',''),(781,'basil-brush-presenter','Basil Brush','basil-brush-presenter.jpg','Basil Brush is one of the most iconic British children\'s TV characters of all time. He is British red fox puppet with a fun, feisty personality. However, Basil Brush isn\'t always a puppet; he is sometimes represented as asn animated fox, and occasionally in children\'s comics. ','Fictional character',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@realbasilbrush',''),(782,'cliff-thorburn-snooker-player','Cliff Thorburn','cliff-thorburn-snooker-player.jpg','Clifford Charles Devlin \"Cliff\" Thorburn CM is a Canadian retired professional snooker player. Nicknamed \"The Grinder\" because of his slow, determined style of play, he won the World Snooker Championship in 1980, making him the first world champion in the sport\'s modern era from outside the United Kingdom.','Snooker Player',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@CliffThorburn',''),(783,'gemma-bissix-actress','Gemma Bissix','gemma-bissix-actress.jpg','Gemma Bissix is an English actress. She has been acting since the age of 9. Her most prominent roles have been in soap operas, as Clare Bates in EastEnders and Clare Devine in Hollyoaks; she was awarded with two British Soap Awards for the latter role. ','Actress',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@Gemma_Bissix',''),(784,'aljaz-skorjanec-dancer','Aljaz Skorjanec','aljaz-skorjanec-dancer.jpg','Aljaz Skorjanec is a Slovenian dancer and choreographer. Aljaz is most famous for his repeated performances on Britain\'s Strictly Come Dancing where he has partnered up with Abbey Clancy, Alison Hammond, Helen George, Dasiy Lowe, Gemma Atkinson, and Kate Silverton over the years.','Professional Dancer',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>     ','@AljazSkorjanec','Yes'),(785,'jeff-mostyn-bournemouth-fc-chairman','Jeff Mostyn','jeff-mostyn-bournemouth-fc-chairman.jpg','Chairman of AFC Bournemouth. Number 1 Passion My Family, Friends & Football','Businessperson',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@jeffmostyn',''),(786,'david-brookes-bournemouth-footballer','David Brooks','david-brookes-bournemouth-footballer.jpg','David Robert Brooks is a professional footballer who plays as a midfielder for Premier League club AFC Bournemouth. He has played for both Wales and England at youth level before making his senior debut for Wales in 2017. ','Footballer',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@DRBrooks15',''),(787,'peter-ebdon-snooker','Peter Ebdon','peter-ebdon-snooker.jpg','Peter David Ebdon is an English professional snooker player. He was World Champion in 2002, beating Stephen Hendry 18â€“17 in the final, and won the UK Championship in 2006 and seven other ranking events between 1993 and 2012. He was also a losing finalist in the World Championship in 1996 and 2006.','English professional snooker player',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@pdebdon',''),(788,'rob-ostlere-actor','Rob Ostlere','rob-ostlere-actor.jpg','Robert \"Rob\" Ostlere is a British actor, best known for his portrayal of Arthur Digby in the medical drama Holby City. He made his first appearance on 2 January 2013 and departed on 7 June 2016.','Actor',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@RobOstlere',''),(789,'radzi-chinyanganya-presenter','Radzi Chinyanganya','radzi-chinyanganya-presenter.jpg','Radzi Chinyanganya is a British children\'s TV presenter for the BB\'C\'s long-running children\'s TV programme, Blue Peter, which he left in April 2019, as over five years working on the show. Radzi Chinyanganya also presented the ITV game show, Cannonball, since 2017. Previously, Chinyanganya also presented \'Wild\' on CBBC. Chinyanganya is also a Sky Sports NBA presenter.','British presenter',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@iamradzi',''),(790,'john-partridge-actor','John Partridge','john-partridge-actor.jpg','John Partridge is an English actor, dancer, singer, panelist and television presenter, who is probably best known for the role of Christian Clarke in the long-running BBC television soap opera EastEnders, having joined the cast in January 2008. ','Actor',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@mustbejp',''),(791,'james-cahill-snooker-player','James Cahill','james-cahill-snooker-player.jpg','James Cahill is an English snooker player from Blackpool. He reached the main stages of the 2019 World Snooker Championship, becoming the first amateur player to ever qualify for the event. He defeated world number one and five-time world champion Ronnie O\'Sullivan 10â€“8 in their first round match. ','English snooker player',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@JamesCahill147',''),(792,'matthew-cottle-actor','Matthew Cottle','matthew-cottle-actor.jpg','ðŸŽ­ Matthew Cottle is an English actor, known for his work across film, stage, radio, and television. ðŸŒŸ With a versatile career, he has appeared in a wide range of productions, showcasing his talent in both drama and comedy. ðŸŽ¬ From notable stage performances to television roles, Matthew has earned respect for his captivating performances. ','Actor',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>    ','@MatthewCottle7',''),(793,'neil-robertson-snooker-player','Neil Robertson','neil-robertson-snooker-player.jpg','Neil Robertson is an Australian professional snooker player. He made his first breakthrough into the top professional ranks in the 2006/2007 season. He won the 2010 World Championship and was the world number one later in the same year, a ranking that he attained again in 2013 and 2014.','Australian snooker player',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@nr147',''),(794,'seema-jaswal-tv-presenter','Seema Jaswal','seema-jaswal-tv-presenter.jpg','Seema Jaswal is a British television and radio presenter from West London. Jaswal hosts the Premier Leagueâ€™s worldwide coverage for Premier League Productions which includes flagship shows Kick Off and Fanzone. When the Premier League season ends, she presents Motorsport for Channel 4.','British television presenter',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@meseemajaswal',''),(797,'craig-charles-presenter-actor','Craig Charles','craig-charles-presenter-actor.jpg','Craig Charles is a British actor, TV presenter, and DJ. Craig Charles origianlly made a name for himself as Dave Lister on the ludicrous sci-fi comedy, Red Dwarf. Later, Charles played Lloyd Mullaney on TV\'s Coronation Street. Beyon acting, Charles became a famous funk and soul DJ on both BBC Radio 6 Music and BBC Radio 2.','British actor',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>    ','@CCfunkandsoul','Yes'),(799,'amelia-lily-singer','Amelia Lily','amelia-lily-singer.jpg','Nunthorpe singer Amelia Lily finished third in the 2011 X Factor competition and later recorded a debut single called \'You Bring Me Joy\' which got to number two in the UK Chart. Amelia is a former Teesside High School, Eaglescliffe, pupil.','Singer','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/twinkle2143\">Photo: Matthew Stone</a>    ','@AmeliaLilyOffic',''),(800,'richard-blackwood-actor','Richard Blackwood','richard-blackwood-actor.jpg','Richard Blackwood is an actor, presenter and rapper. Between 2015 and 2018, he played Vincent Hubbard in the BBC soap EastEnders. Now touring in various shows including Shrek and Aladdin during Christmas 2019.','Actor','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/twinkle2143\">Photo: Matthew Stone</a>    ','@RB_Official',''),(801,'lisa-armstrong-make-up-artist','Lisa Armstrong','lisa-armstrong-make-up-artist.jpg','Lisa Marie Armstrong is a former member of pop band Deuce and was make-up expert for the ITV programme This Morning, until becoming make-up supervisor for the ITV quiz show Pick Me and its prime-time entertainment series Ant & Dec\'s Saturday Night Takeaway','MakeUp and Celeb Ex',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>','@lisaAmakeup',''),(802,'mark-curry-presenter','Mark Curry','mark-curry-presenter.jpg','ðŸŽ¤ Mark Preston Curry is an English actor and TV and radio presenter, best known for his time on Blue Peter in the late \'80s. ðŸŒŸ He became a familiar face on both ITV and the BBC, engaging audiences with his warm personality. ðŸŽ™ï¸ Mark has continued to appear on various television and radio shows, showcasing his versatility as a presenter. ','Actor / Presenter',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@curry_markcurry',''),(803,'gemma-oaten-actress','Gemma Oaten','gemma-oaten-actress.jpg','Emmerdale star Gemma Oaten has shared an emotional message and throwback pictures on Instagram after the soap killed off her character Rachel Breckle last night. Rachel died from a suspected heart attack off screen, meaning that Jai Sharma was suddenly reunited with their son Archie','Actress',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>','@gemmaoaten',''),(804,'stephen-mullhern-presenter','Stephen Mulhern','stephen-mulhern-presenter.jpg','Stephen Daniel Mulhern is an English television presenter, entertainer, magician and showbiz personality. Mulhern has presented the ITV2 spin-off series Britain\'s Got More Talent since 2007 and has more recently presented ITV game shows including Catchphrase, Big Star\'s Little Star and In for a Penny.','Television presenter',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@StephenMulhern','Yes'),(805,'isabel-hodgins-actress','Isabel Hodgins','isabel-hodgins-actress.jpg','Isabel Victoria Hodgins is an English actress. She is best known for portraying the current character, Victoria Sugden, in the ITV soap opera Emmerdale, since 2006. The character of Victoria was born in 1994 and has remained in the show ever since','Actress',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>','@Hodge_Isabel',''),(806,'alan-halsall-and-jack-p-shepherd-actors','Jack P Shepherd & Alan Halsall','alan-halsall-and-jack-p-shepherd-actors.jpg','Alan David Halsall, English actor known for playing Tyrone Dobbs in Coronation Street, a role which he has played since 1998 and Jack Peter Shepherd, English actor. He has portrayed the character of David Platt in the ITV soap opera Coronation Street since April 2000. He won the 2018 British Soap Award for Best Actor and the 2008 British Soap Award for Villain of the year.','Actors',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>','@JackPShepherd88',''),(807,'george-alagiah-british-journalist','George Alagiah','george-alagiah-british-journalist.jpg','George Maxwell Alagiah OBE is a British newsreader, journalist and television news presenter. Since 3 December 2007, he has been the presenter of the BBC News at Six and has also been the main presenter of GMT on BBC World News since its launch on 1 February 2010.','British journalist',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>','@BBCAlagiah',''),(808,'david-baddiel-comedian','David Baddiel','david-baddiel-comedian.jpg','David Lionel Baddiel is an English comedian, novelist and television presenter. He is known for his work alongside Rob Newman in The Mary Whitehouse Experience and partnership with Frank Skinner.','Comedian',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@Baddiel','Yes'),(809,'craig-gazey-actor','Craig Gazey','craig-gazey-actor.jpg','Craig Gazey is a British stage and television actor, best known for his portrayal of Graeme Proctor in the ITV soap Coronation Street.','Television actor',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>','@craigazey',''),(810,'rob-beckett-comedian','Rob Beckett','rob-beckett-comedian.jpg','Robert Anthony Beckett is an English stand-up comedian and presenter. He was a co-host on the ITV2 spin-off show I\'m a Celebrity...Get Me Out of Here! NOW! from 2012 to 2014. Since 2016, Beckett has been a team captain on the E4 panel show 8 Out of 10 Cats and the narrator of the reality series Celebs Go Dating.','Stand-up comedian',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@robbeckettcomic','Yes'),(811,'simon-reeve-author','Simon Reeve','simon-reeve-author.jpg','Simon Alan Reeve is a British author and television presenter, currently based in London. He makes travel documentaries and has written books on international terrorism, modern history and his adventures. He has presented the BBC television series Tropic of Cancer, Equator and Tropic of Capricorn.','British author',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@simon_reeve',''),(812,'rob-brydon-comedian','Rob Brydon','rob-brydon-comedian.jpg','ðŸŽ­ Robert Brydon, MBE, is a Welsh comedian, actor, radio and television presenter, singer, and impressionist, known for his sharp wit and hilarious impressions. ðŸŒŸ Heâ€™s become a familiar face on TV, captivating audiences with his comedic talent and charm. ðŸŽ¤ From his work on Would I Lie to You? to his stand-up shows, Robertâ€™s versatility has made him a favorite in British entertainment. ','Comedian',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@RobBrydon','Yes'),(813,'lee-mack-comedian','Lee Mack','lee-mack-comedian.jpg','Lee Mack is a talented English comedian and actor, best known for writing and starring in the hit sitcom Not Going Out. ðŸŒŸ His quick wit and sharp humour have made him a beloved figure in British comedy, further cemented by his role as a team captain on BBC Oneâ€™s Would I Lie to You?. With his unique style and infectious personality, Lee has become a household name. ','Comedian',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@LeeMack','Yes'),(814,'david-mitchell-comedian','David Mitchell','david-mitchell-comedian.jpg','David Mitchell is a comedian, actor, writer and television presenter. He is half of the comedy duo Mitchell and Webb, alongside Robert Webb. The duo starred in the Channel 4 sitcom Peep Show, in which Mitchell plays Mark Corrigan.','British comedian',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@RealDMitchell','Yes'),(815,'jack-carroll-bgt','Jack Carroll','jack-carroll-bgt.jpg','Jack Carroll is an English comedian and actor. Carroll competed in the seventh series of Britain\'s Got Talent at the age of 14, finishing as the runner-up. As an actor, he appeared in two series of the CBBC series Ministry of Curious Stuff and from 2014 to 2018, he starred in the Sky sitcom Trollied','Comedian',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>','@fatjacko',''),(816,'frank-skinner-comedian','Frank Skinner','frank-skinner-comedian.jpg','Frank Skinner is an writer, comedian, TV and radio presenter, and actor. At the 2001 British Comedy Awards, he was awarded the Best Comedy Entertainment Personality.','Comedian & Writer',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a> ','@FrankOnTheRadio','Yes'),(817,'john-sopel-correspondent','John Sopel','john-sopel-correspondent.jpg','Jonathan B. Sopel is a British television presenter and correspondent for the BBC\'s international television news channel, BBC World News, currently serving as the North America Editor for the BBC.','British television presenter',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>','@BBCJonSopel',''),(818,'susan-calman-comedian','Susan Calman','susan-calman-comedian.jpg','Susan Calman is a Scottish comedian, writer and TV presenter known for her sharp humour and upbeat, engaging style. She first gained attention through her BBC Radio 4 sitcom Sisters and stand-up shows like Susan Calman Is Convicted, later becoming a regular on The News Quiz and Iâ€™m Sorry I Havenâ€™t a Clue. She reached week 10 on Strictly Come Dancing in 2017 and now hosts popular Channel 5 travel series. Susan also joins the Santa Radio MugShots lineup with festive cheer.','Comedian','Bruce Davis','@SusanCalman',''),(819,'jurgen-klopp-liverpool-manager','Jurgen Klopp','jurgen-klopp-liverpool-manager.jpg','JÃ¼rgen Klopp is a German football manager and former player who is the manager of Premier League club Liverpool. Often credited with popularising the football philosophy known as Gegenpressing, Klopp is regarded by many as one of the best managers in the world.','Football manager',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@JurgenOfficial','Yes'),(820,'jake-humphrey-presenter','Jake Humphrey','jake-humphrey-presenter.jpg','Jake Humphrey is an television presenter and journalist, best known for presenting CBBC\'s BAMZOOKi, and BBC Sport\'s coverage of Formula One from 2009 until 2012. He is the main presenter of BT Sport football coverage and Director of Whisper Films. ','English television presenter',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stalkerbruce\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>','@mrjakehumphrey',''),(822,'kell-brook-boxer','Kell Brook','kell-brook-boxer.jpg','Ezekiel \"Kell\" Brook is a British professional boxer. He held the IBF welterweight title from 2014 to 2017, and has challenged once for a unified middleweight title in 2016. At regional level he held the British welterweight title from 2008 to 2010.\r\n','Boxer',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@SpecialKBrook',''),(823,'janette-manara-dancer','Janette Manrara','janette-manara-dancer.jpg','Janette Manrara is an American professional dancer and choreographer from Miami, Florida. Originally a Salsa dancer, learning from her Cuban family, she formally studied dance from the age of 19','American professional dancer',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@JManrara',''),(824,'harry-gration-presenter','Harry Gration','harry-gration-presenter.jpg','Harry Gration, MBE is an English journalist and broadcaster in Leeds. He is one of the main anchors for the BBC Yorkshire regional magazine programme Look North. ','Journalist',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@BBCLookNorth',''),(825,'paul-hendy-presenter','Paul Hendy','paul-hendy-presenter.jpg','Paul Hendy is a script-writer, novelist, director, producer and filmmaker. In his early career, he was a TV presenter hosting the BAFTA nominated Dear Mr Barker, Donâ€™t Try This at Home, The Disney Club, and Wheel of Fortune. He was a regular reporter on ITVâ€™s This Morning and hosted â€˜Stash the Cashâ€™.','TV presenter',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','',''),(826,'oti-mabuse-dancer','Otlile Mabuse','oti-mabuse-dancer.jpg','Otlile \"Oti\" Mabuse is a South African professional Latin American and ballroom dancer. She is best known as a professional dancer on the British television series, Strictly Come Dancing, and its German equivalent, Let\'s Dance. She is also a captain on The Greatest Dancer.','Professional Dancer',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@OtiMabuse',''),(827,'ian-waite-dancer','Ian Waite','ian-waite-dancer.jpg','Ian Waite is a professional dancer specialising in Latin American dance, a teacher and choreographer. ','Professional Dancer','Photo: Bruce Davis','ianwaite',''),(828,'motsi-mabuse-strictly-judge-dancer','Motsi Mabuse','motsi-mabuse-strictly-judge-dancer.jpg','Motsi Mabuse is a talented South African dancer, known for her appearances on Let\'s Dance, the German version of Strictly Come Dancing. ðŸŒŸ Motsi\'s incredible dance skills and infectious energy earned her a place as a judge on Strictly Come Dancing UK, where she brings her expertise to the panel. ðŸŽ­ Her dynamic presence and insightful feedback have made her a fan favorite. ','Dancer & Judge',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@MOTSI_MABUSE',''),(829,'claudia-winkleman-presenter','Claudia Winkleman','claudia-winkleman-presenter.jpg','Claudia Anne Winkleman is an English television presenter, model, film critic, radio personality, and journalist. Between 2004 and 2010, she Co presents Strictly Come Dancing on BBC 1.','Television presenter',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@ClaudiaWinkle','Yes'),(830,'jamie-lomas-actor','Jamie Lomas','jamie-lomas-actor.jpg','James Lomas is an English television actor, known for his roles as Warren Fox in Hollyoaks and Jake Stone in EastEnders and Jeff Durkin in Coronation Street. Lomas was born in Manchester.','Actor',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@jamielomas1',''),(831,'ole-gunnar-solsha-man-united-manager','Ole Gunnar Solskaer','ole-gunnar-solsha-man-united-manager.jpg','Ole Gunnar SolskjÃ¦r KSO is a Norwegian professional football manager and former player. He is currently the manager of English club Manchester United. As a player, he played as a forward and spent most of his career with Manchester United.','Football Manager',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@olegs26_ole',''),(832,'harry-rednapp-football-manager','Harry Redknapp','harry-rednapp-football-manager.jpg','Henry James Redknapp is an English football manager and former player. He has previously managed AFC Bournemouth, West Ham United, Portsmouth, Southampton, Tottenham Hotspur, Queens Park Rangers and Birmingham City. In his second spell at Portsmouth, he managed the side that won the 2008 FA Cup.','Football Manager',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@Redknapp','Yes'),(833,'siobhan-fahey-actress','Siobhan Fahey','siobhan-fahey-actress.jpg','Siobhan MÃ¡ire Deirdre Fahey is an Irish singer and musician, whose vocal range is a light contralto. She was a founding member of the 1980s British girl group Bananarama, who had several top 10 hits including the US number one hit single \"Venus\".','Singer',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@Siobhan_Fahe',''),(834,'edele-lynch-actress','Edele Lynch','edele-lynch-actress.jpg','Edele Claire Christina Edwina Lynch is an Irish singer-songwriter, musician, dancer and actress. She is best known as the lead singer of Irish girl group B*Witched, of which her twin sister Keavy is also a member. Their brother Shane is a member of boy band Boyzone.','Edele Lynch',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@edelelynch',''),(835,'john-challis-actor','John Challis','john-challis-actor.jpg','John Spurley Challis is an English actor best known for portraying Aubrey \"Boycie\" Boyce in the long-running BBC television comedy series Only Fools and Horses and its sequel/spin-off The Green Green Grass.','Actor',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@BeingBoycie',''),(836,'karim-zeroual-presenter','Karim Zeroual','karim-zeroual-presenter.jpg','If youâ€™ve got little ones youâ€™ll probably recognise Karim Zeroual from CBBC HQ, where heâ€™s a familiar face known for presenting BBC Young Dancer and Wimbledon LIVE. Heâ€™s also fronted Ten Pieces Party Live Lesson events with the BBC National Orchestra and hosted interviews at CBBC Summer Social events with a range of amazing childrenâ€™s authors.','Actor',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@kayzer_1',''),(837,'kelvin-fletcher-actor','Kelvin Fletcher','kelvin-fletcher-actor.jpg','Kelvin Warren Fletcher is an English actor, writer, model and racing driver who played Andy Sugden for 20 years in the long-running television soap opera Emmerdale from 1996 to 2016. Alongside acting Fletcher is also a professional racing driver currently racing in the British GT Championship. ','Actor',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@kelvin_fletcher',''),(838,'johannes-radebe-dancer','Johannes Radebe','johannes-radebe-dancer.jpg','Johannes Radebe is a South African dancer and choreographer. Now a pro dancer on Strictly on the BBC.','Professional Dancer',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@jojo_radebe','Yes'),(839,'ade-adepitan-paralympion','Ade Adepitan','ade-adepitan-paralympion.jpg','Adedoyin Olayiwola \"Ade\" Adepitan MBE is a British television presenter and wheelchair basketball player. He uses a wheelchair as a result of contracting polio as a child which led to the loss of use of his left leg.','Television presenter',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>    ','@AdeAdepitan',''),(840,'ainsley-harriott-presenter-chef','Ainsley Harriott','ainsley-harriott-presenter-chef.jpg','Ainsley Harriott is an English chef, television presenter, and entertainer. He is known for his BBC cooking shows Can\'t Cook, Won\'t Cook and Ready Steady Cook. ','Chef','Photo: Bruce Davis','@AinsleyFoods',''),(841,'alex-scott-footballer','Alex Scott','alex-scott-footballer.jpg','Alexandra Virina Scott MBE is an English former footballer who mostly played as a right-back for Arsenal in the FA WSL. She made 140 appearances for the English national team and also represented Great Britain at the 2012 London Olympics. ','Footballer',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@AlexScott',''),(842,'andy-hamilton-comedian-writer','Andy Hamilton','andy-hamilton-comedian-writer.jpg','Andrew Neil Hamilton is a British comedian, game show panellist, television director, comedy screenwriter, radio dramatist, and novelist.','Comedian',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@AndyHam_OnTour',''),(843,'barry-hearn-snooker-chairman','Barry Hearn','barry-hearn-snooker-chairman.jpg','Barry Maurice William Hearn is an English sporting events promoter and the founder and chairman of promotions company Matchroom Sport. Through Matchroom, Hearn is also involved in many sports, including pool, tenpin bowling, golf, table tennis and fishing.','Promoter',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@BarryHearn',''),(844,'calum-best-presenter','Calum Best','calum-best-presenter.jpg','Calum Best is a well-known presenter and television personality, recognised for his charm and charisma. The son of football legend George Best, Calum has carved out his own path in the entertainment industry, hosting a variety of shows and appearing on numerous reality programmes. His engaging personality continues to captivate audiences across the UK.','TV Personality',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@CalumBest',''),(845,'chris-rogers-bbc-newsreader','Chris Rogers','chris-rogers-bbc-newsreader.jpg','Chris Rogers is a British broadcast journalist specialising in investigative journalism, and news presenter. He is among the long line up of presenters that began their career presenting BBC Newsround moving on to present and report for Sky News including its BAFTA Award-winning coverage of the 9/11 attacks. ','News Reader',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@ChrisRogersTV',''),(846,'chris-walker-actor','Chris Walker','chris-walker-actor.jpg','Christopher Walker is an English actor, known for his roles as Matthew Mullen in the BBC drama Playing the Field and Rob Hollins in the BBC soap opera Doctors. ','Actor',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@Chriswalkeract',''),(847,'simon-rimmer-presenter-chef','Simon Rimmer','simon-rimmer-presenter-chef.jpg','Simon Peter Rimmer is an English cook and restaurateur, best known for his on-screen partnership with Tim Lovejoy.','Cook & Presenter',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@simonrim','Yes'),(848,'daisy-wood-davis-actress','Daisy Wood-Davis','daisy-wood-davis-actress.jpg','Daisy Wood-Davis is a British singer and actress. She originally comes from Bromley, south east London. Wood-Davis started her career at an early age in various professional shows and has signed a record deal with Universal Music','Actress',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@Daisy_wooddavis',''),(849,'sara-cox-radio-dj','Sara Cox','sara-cox-radio-dj.jpg','Sara Joanne Cyzer more commonly known by her professional name Sara Cox, is an English broadcaster and model. She presented the Breakfast Show on BBC Radio 1 between 3 April 2000 and 19 December 2003. She currently hosts Drivetime on BBC Radio 2 Mondayâ€“Friday 17:00â€“19:00','Radio Presenter',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@sarajcox','Yes'),(850,'seann-walsh-comedian','Seann Walsh','seann-walsh-comedian.jpg','Sean Walsh, known professionally as Seann Walsh, is an English comedian and actor.','Comedian',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@seannwalsh',''),(851,'terry-waite-journalist-writer','Terry Waite','terry-waite-journalist-writer.jpg','Terence Hardy \"Terry\" Waite CBE is an English humanitarian and author. Waite was the Assistant for Anglican Communion Affairs for the then Archbishop of Canterbury, Robert Runcie, in the 1980s.','Humanitarian',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','',''),(852,'johnny-vegas-actor-comedian','Johnny Vegas','johnny-vegas-actor-comedian.jpg','Michael Joseph Pennington, better known as Johnny Vegas, is an English comedian and actor. He is known for his portly figure, angry comedic rants, surreal humour, northern accent, and husky voice.','Comedian',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@JohnnyVegasReal','Yes'),(853,'jimmy-white-snooker-player','Jimmy White','jimmy-white-snooker-player.jpg','James Warren White, MBE is an English professional snooker player who now competes with an invitational tour card.','Snooker Player',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@jimmywhite147',''),(854,'lisa-appleton-presenter','Lisa Appleton','lisa-appleton-presenter.jpg','LISA Appleton is a well-loved reality TV star, who first hit our screens as a Big Brother housemate in 2008. ... The brunette troublemaker is best-known for appearing on the 2008 series of Big Brother, where she entered the house with her then boyfriend Mario Marconi.','TV Personality',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@MsLisaAppleton',''),(855,'tim-healy-actor','Tim Healy','tim-healy-actor.jpg','Timothy Malcolm Healy is an English actor, best known for playing Dennis Patterson in the television series Auf Wiedersehen, Pet, Les/Lesley in the ITV comedy series Benidorm and Gastric in Still Open All Hours.','Actor',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@TheRealTimHealy',''),(856,'steve-lamacq-radio-dj','Steve Lamacq','steve-lamacq-radio-dj.jpg','Stephen Lamacq, sometimes known by his nickname Lammo, is an English disc jockey, currently working with the BBC radio station BBC Radio 6 Music.','Radio Presenter',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@steve_lamacq',''),(857,'greg-james-radio-presenter-dj','Greg James','greg-james-radio-presenter-dj.jpg','Gregory James Alan Milward is an English radio DJ, television presenter and author. He hosts The Radio 1 Breakfast Show on BBC Radio 1 and co-presents the BBC television series Sounds Like Friday Night.','Radio Presenter',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@gregjames','Yes'),(858,'chris-smith-radio-presenter','Chris Smith','chris-smith-radio-presenter.jpg','Christopher Smith, known professionally as Chris Smith, is an English radio newsreader. He is most famous for presenting Newsbeat on BBC Radio 1 and co-hosting the That\'s What He Said Podcast alongside Greg James.\r\n','Radio presenter',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>  ','@itschrissmith',''),(859,'joe-mcfadden-actor','Joe McFadden','joe-mcfadden-actor.jpg','Joe McFadden is a Scottish actor known for his roles in The Crow Road, Chips & Rock n\' Roll, Heartbeat and Holby City.  Joe won the 2017 series of BBC\'s Strictly Come Dancing with dance partner Katya Jones.','Actor','  <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@mrjoemcfadden',''),(860,'richie-anderson','Richie Anderson','richie-anderson-bbc-radio-2.jpg','Richie Anderson is a TV and radio personality who works for the BBC. He is a former Sunday League footballer who played for Coombs Wood F.C. Anderson currently presents the travel on weekday mornings on BBC Radio 2. ','Radio 2 Presenter',' Photo: Bruce Davis ','@richie_anderson',''),(861,'zoe-ball-bbc-radio-2','Zoe Ball','zoe-ball-bbc-radio-2.jpg','Zoe Ball is a hugely popular British radio and TV presenter, best known as the first woman to host both the Radio 1 Breakfast Show and the Radio 2 Breakfast Show for the BBC. She first became a household name in the 1990s, co-presenting Live & Kicking with Jamie Theakston from 1996 to 1999. With her warm style and lively on-air presence, Zoe remains one of the UKâ€™s most trusted and recognisable broadcasters.','Radio 2 Presenter',' Photo: Bruce Davis    ','@ZoeTheBall','Yes'),(862,'adam-woodyatt-eastenders-actor','Adam Woodyatt','adam-woodyatt-eastenders-actor.jpg','Adam Brinley Woodyatt is an English actor, best known for his role as Ian Beale in the BBC soap opera EastEnders. Alongside Jane Slaughter, Woodyatt is the programme\'s longest-serving cast member, having played the role since the first episode in 1985','Eastenders Actor',' Photo: Bruce Davis     ','@AdamWoodyatt','No'),(863,'james-and-robin-grumbleweeds','James and Robin','james-and-robin-grumbleweeds.jpg','The Grumbleweeds are an award winning British comedy band, performing music and comedy. They were mostly popular on radio and television in the 1980s, including The Grumbleweeds Radio Show which ran from 1979 to 1988 on BBC Radio 2.','Grumbleweeds Singers',' Photo: Bruce Davis  ','@GrumbleweedsUK',''),(864,'james-quinn-actor','James Quinn','james-quinn-actor.jpg','Actor, Writer, Voice Over Artist. Matchday commentator for FC United\'s FCUM Radio.','Actor',' Photo: Bruce Davis ','@jamquinn',''),(865,'alex-belfield-vlogger','Alex Belfield','alex-belfield-vlogger.jpg','Alex Belfield is a well-known vlogger and former radio presenter, recognised for his outspoken commentary and engaging video content. He has built a significant following on social media, sharing his unique insights on current events and entertainment. Alex\'s dynamic personality and sharp wit keep his audience coming back for more.','Vlogger',' Photo: Bruce Davis  ','@celebrityradio',''),(866,'scott-robinson-singer','Scott Robinson','scott-robinson-singer.jpg','Scott Robinson is an English singer best known for being a member of the boy band Five.','Singer',' Photo: Bruce Davis ','',''),(867,'george-potter-brighton-manager','Graham Potter','george-potter-brighton-manager.jpg','Graham Stephen Potter is an English professional football manager and former player who played as a left back. He is the head coach of Premier League club Brighton & Hove Albion. In a 13-year playing career, he made 307 appearances in the Football League.','Brighton Football Manager',' Photo: Bruce Davis  ','',''),(868,'kate-botley-bbc-radio2-presenter','Rev Kate Botley','kate-botley-bbc-radio2-presenter.jpg','Kate Bottley is a part-time Church of England priest in North Nottinghamshire, a role which she combines with her other roles of journalist, media presenter and reality television star. She appears frequently on British radio and television as well as in newspapers.','BBC Radio 2 Presenter',' Photo: Bruce Davis ','@revkatebottley',''),(869,'steve-royal-comedian','Steve Royle','steve-royal-comedian.jpg','BGT2020 Third place & That juggler in Phoenix Nights Live at Manchester Arena! Comedian, Radio Presenter, Actor, Panto performer and Dad!\r\n','Comedian',' Photo: Bruce Davis ','@steveroylecomic',''),(870,'gareth-southgate-england-football-manager','Gareth Southgate','gareth-southgate-england-football-manager.jpg','Gareth Southgate OBE is an English football manager and former player who played as a defender and midfielder. He has been the manager of the England national team since 2016.','England Football Manager',' Photo: Bruce Davis   ','@GarethSouthgate','Yes'),(871,'george-sampson-actor','George Sampson','george-sampson-actor.jpg','Currently playing Dean in @Jamiemusical tour. All links below\r\n','Actor',' Photo: Bruce Davis ','@georgesampson',''),(872,'mark-read-a1-singer','Mark Read','mark-read-a1-singer.jpg','Mark Daniel Read is an English singer/songwriter, best known as member of the boy band A1 from 1998 to 2002, and 2009 to the present.','Singer',' Photo: Bruce Davis ','@MarkReadMusic',''),(873,'richie-nevell-singer','Richie Nevell','richie-nevell-singer.jpg','ðŸŽ¤ Richard Neville Dobson is a British sommelier, restaurateur, and singer from Solihull, England, best known as a member of the popular boy band Five. ðŸŒŸ His vocal talents contributed to the groupâ€™s success, with hits like Keep On Movin\' and When the Lights Go Out. ðŸŽ¶ After his music career, Richard pursued a career in hospitality, showcasing his passion for fine wine and dining.','Singer',' Photo: Bruce Davis  ','@RitchieNeville',''),(874,'spike-911-singer','Spike','spike-911-singer.jpg','Simon James \"Spike\" Dawbarn is an English singer and dancer. He is a member of the boy band 911, who were originally active between 1995 and 2000 and had ten consecutive top 10 hits before splitting up in 2000. ','911 Singer',' Photo: Bruce Davis ','',''),(875,'shane-richie-actor-singer','Shane Richie','shane-richie-actor-singer.jpg','Shane Patrick Paul Roche, known as Shane Richie, is a British actor, comedian, television presenter and singer. ','Actor & Singer',' Photo: Bruce Davis  ','@realshanerichie',''),(876,'shobna-gulati-actress','Shobna Gulati','shobna-gulati-actress.jpg','Shobna Gulati DL is an English actress and presenter. Gulati is known for her roles as Anita in dinnerladies, Sunita Alahan in the soap opera Coronation Street from 2001 to 2013. From 2013 to 2014, Gulati appeared as a panellist on the lunchtime talk show Loose Women. ','Actress',' Photo: Bruce Davis  ','@TeamShobna',''),(877,'lee-and-jimmy-a1-singers','Lee-and Jimmy','lee-and-jimmy-a1-singers.jpg','A1 are a British-Norwegian boy band that formed in 1998. The original line-up consists of Paul Marazzi, Christian Ingebrigtsen, Mark Read and Ben Adams. Ingebrigtsen is originally from Oslo, Norway, but the other members originate from London.','A1 Singers',' Photo: Bruce Davis ','@A1Official',''),(878,'a1-singers','A1','a1-singers.jpg','A1 are a Britishâ€“Norwegian pop group formed in 1998, originally made up of Ben Adams, Mark Read, Christian Ingebrigtsen and Paul Marazzi. They scored huge success in the late â€™90s and early 2000s with hits like â€œTake On Meâ€ and â€œSame Old Brand New You,â€ earning a BRIT Award in 2001 for Best British Breakthrough Act. After reuniting, the band continue to tour and keep their loyal fanbase happily nostalgic.','Singers',' Photo: Bruce Davis       ','@A1Official','No'),(879,'pep-guardiola-man-city-manager','Pep Guardiola','pep-guardiola-man-city-manager.jpg','âš½ Josep \"Pep\" Guardiola Sala is a renowned Spanish football manager and former player, currently managing Premier League club Manchester City. ðŸŒŸ Pep has earned widespread acclaim for his tactical genius and success, leading Manchester City to multiple victories. ðŸ† As a player, he had a distinguished career, notably with FC Barcelona.','Man City Manager',' Photo: Bruce Davis  ','',''),(880,'damage-band','Damage','damage-band.jpg','Damage were a British R&B boy band who achieved success in the 1990s with eleven hit singles, including four top 10 successes on the UK Singles Chart. They have sold 2.6 million records worldwide. The band consists of Jade Jones, Rahsaan J Bromfield, Andrez Harriott, CoreÃ© Richards and Noel Simpson.','Band',' Photo: Bruce Davis ','',''),(881,'carlo-ancelotti-everton-football-manager','Carlo Ancelotti','carlo-ancelotti-everton-football-manager.jpg','Carlo Ancelotti Cavaliere OMRI, Cavaliere OSI is an Italian professional football manager and former player who manages La Liga club Real Madrid. Ancelotti is one of only three managers to have won the UEFA Champions League three times, and one of only two to have managed teams in four finals.','Everton Football Manager',' Photo: Bruce Davis  ','@MrAncelotti',''),(882,'nuno-espirito-santo-wolves-manager','Nuno Espirito Santo','nuno-espirito-santo-wolves-manager.jpg','Nuno Herlander SimÃµes EspÃ­rito Santo, known simply as Nuno as a player, is a Portuguese football manager and former footballer who played as a goalkeeper. He is the head coach of Premier League club Tottenham Hotspur. During his career he first made a name for himself in Spain, playing for three teams in five years.','Wolves Football Manager',' Photo: Bruce Davis ','',''),(883,'colin-murray-radio-presenter','Colin Murray','colin-murray-radio-presenter.jpg','Colin Murray is a Northern Irish radio and television presenter. In 2010, he became host of BBC Television\'s Match of the Day 2 on BBC Two, while still anchoring shows on BBC Radio 5 Live, including 5 Live Sport and Fighting Talk and was still presenting on BBC Radio Ulster. ','Radio Presenter',' Photo: Bruce Davis ','@ColinMurray',''),(884,'scott-parker-football-manager','Scott Parker','scott-parker-football-manager.jpg','Scott Matthew Parker is an English professional football manager and former player who played as a midfielder. He is the head coach of EFL Championship club AFC Bournemouth. Parker began his career at Charlton Athletic, and was loaned to Norwich City, before joining Chelsea for a Â£10 million fee in January 2004','English Association Football Manager',' Photo: Bruce Davis   ','',''),(885,'frank-lampard-footballer','Frank Lampard','frank-lampard-footballer.jpg','Frank James Lampard OBE is an English professional football manager and former player who was the head coach of Premier League club Chelsea from July 2019 until January 2021. He is widely considered to be one of Chelsea\'s greatest ever players, and one of the greatest midfielders of his generation. ','Footballer',' Photo: Bruce Davis  ','','Yes'),(886,'stephanie-hirst-radio-presenter','Stephanie Hirst','stephanie-hirst-radio-presenter.jpg','Stephanie Hirst is an English radio presenter who started working for BBC Radio Leeds in 2018. She has hosted Hit40UK and the weekday breakfast show on Capital Yorkshire Hirsty\'s Daily Dose.','Radio Presenter',' Photo: Bruce Davis ','@StephanieHirst',''),(887,'gayle-lofthouse-radio-presenter','Gayle Lofthouse','gayle-lofthouse-radio-presenter.jpg','Gayle Lofthouse is a talented radio presenter known for her dynamic and engaging presence on air. With a career spanning various radio stations, Gayle\'s energetic style and relatable personality have made her a favourite among listeners. Her ability to connect with her audience ensures her shows are always entertaining and memorable.','Radio Presenter',' Photo: Bruce Davis  ','',''),(888,'paul-burrell-royal-butler','Paul Burrell','paul-burrell-royal-butler.jpg','Official Paul Burrell Twitter Account. Former Footman to HM Majesty Queen Elizabeth ll and Butler to the late Princess Diana. New York Times Bestselling Author.','Royal Butler',' Photo: Bruce Davis ','@PaulBurrell_RVM',''),(889,'rosemary-shrager-presenter-chef','Rosemary Shrager','rosemary-shrager-presenter-chef.jpg','Rosemary Jacqueline Shrager is a British chef and TV presenter, best known for being an haute cuisine teacher on the reality television programme Ladette to Lady, and as a judge on Soapstar Superchef. She also made an appearance on the reality TV series I\'m A Celebrity... Get Me Out Of Here!.','TV Presenter & chef',' Photo: Bruce Davis  ','@RosemaryShrager',''),(890,'jonathan-swain-gmb-reporter','Jonathan Swain','jonathan-swain-gmb-reporter.jpg','Dad, husband, usually do lots of stuff & news bloke from Good Morning Britain. Senior News Correspondent \r\nat GMB','GMB Reporter',' Photo: Bruce Davis  ','@SwainITV',''),(891,'laura-tobin-gmb-presenter','Laura Tobin','laura-tobin-gmb-presenter.jpg','Laura Elizabeth Tobin FRMS is an English broadcast meteorologist, currently employed by ITV. Tobin worked for the BBC before moving to the ITV Breakfast programme Daybreak in 2012. Daybreak was later replaced by Good Morning Britain in early 2014. Tobin currently presents the weather bulletins for the programme.\r\n','GMB Presenter',' Photo: Bruce Davis ','@Lauratobin1',''),(892,'lee-latchford-evans-steps-singer','Lee Latchford Evans','lee-latchford-evans-steps-singer.jpg',' Lee Latchford-Evans is an English singer, dancer, and stage actor, best known as one of the five members of the iconic British pop group Steps. ðŸŒŸ With his captivating performances and powerful vocals, Lee has helped propel the group to stardom, earning chart-topping hits and a dedicated fan base. ðŸŽ­ Beyond music, he is also a personal trainer, sharing his passion for fitness. ','Steps Singer',' Photo: Bruce Davis  ','@llatchfordevans',''),(893,'jake-quickenden-singer','Jake Quickenden','jake-quickenden-singer.jpg','Jacob \"Jake\" Quickenden is an English singer, footballer and reality television personality. He was a contestant on the ninth and eleventh series of The X Factor in 2012 and 2014, before being runner-up in series 14 of I\'m a Celebrity...Get Me Out of Here! in December 2014.\r\n','Singer',' Photo: Bruce Davis  ','@JakeQuickenden',''),(894,'jorgie-porter-actress','Jorgie Porter','jorgie-porter-actress.jpg','Jorgina Porter is an English actress and model. She is known for portraying the role of Theresa McQueen in the Channel 4 soap opera Hollyoaks from 2008 until 2016 and again from 2020.','Actress',' Photo: Bruce Davis  ','@misJORGIEPORTER',''),(895,'marcus-collins-x-factor-singer','Marcus Collins','marcus-collins-x-factor-singer.jpg','Marcus Collins is an English singer who finished as the runner-up of the eighth series of The X Factor in 2011. Collins finished second to 4-piece girlband Little Mix. Whilst on The X Factor, he was mentored by Take That frontman Gary Barlow, who continued to work with Collins on his debut album. \r\n','Singer',' Photo: Bruce Davis  ','@MarcuscollinsUK',''),(896,'james-acaster-comedian','James Acaster','james-acaster-comedian.jpg','James William Acaster is an English comedian originally from Kettering, Northamptonshire, who now lives in London. He has performed for several consecutive years at the Edinburgh Festival Fringe and has been nominated for Best Show five times.','Comedian',' Photo: Bruce Davis   ','','Yes'),(897,'roy-hodgeson-crystal-palace-football-manager','Roy Hodgeson','roy-hodgeson-crystal-palace-football-manager.jpg','Roy Hodgson CBE is an English former football manager and former player. He has managed 16 different teams in eight countries, beginning in Sweden with Halmstads BK in the 1976 season.','Crystal Palace Football Manager',' Photo: Bruce Davis ','',''),(898,'chris-wilder-sheffield-united-manager','Chris Wilder','chris-wilder-sheffield-united-manager.jpg','Christopher John Wilder is an English professional football manager and former player who played as a right-back. He was most recently the manager of EFL Championship club Sheffield United.','Sheffield United Football Manager',' Photo: Bruce Davis  ','',''),(899,'molly-mae-love-island','Molly Mae Love','molly-mae-love-island.jpg','Molly-Mae Hague was an Islander on Season 5 of the revived series of Love Island. Molly-Mae entered the villa on Day 4 and was crowned the runner-up','TV personality',' Photo: Bruce Davis ','',''),(900,'brendan-rodgers-leicester-city-manager','Brendan Rodgers','brendan-rodgers-leicester-city-manager.jpg','Brendan Rodgers is a Northern Irish professional football manager and former player who is the manager of Premier League club Leicester City.','Leicester City Football Manager',' Photo: Bruce Davis  ','',''),(901,'sasha-parkinson-actress','Sasha Parkinson','sasha-parkinson-actress.jpg','Sacha Louise Parkinson is an English actress, known for her role as Sian Powers on the ITV soap opera Coronation Street. ','Actress',' Photo: Bruce Davis ','@SachaLParkinson',''),(902,'peter-duncan-actor','Peter Duncan','peter-duncan-actor.jpg','Peter Duncan, born on May 3, 1954, in Chelsea, London, is an English actor and television presenter, best known for his adventurous role on the BBC\'s Blue Peter in the 1980s. ðŸŒŸ Before his TV career, Peter trained at the Italia Conti Academy and performed with the National Theatre. ðŸŽ¬ His acting credits include Flash Gordon (1980) and various stage productions. Beyond acting, Peter served as the UKâ€™s Chief Scout from 2004 to 2009.','Actor',' Photo: Bruce Davis   ','@peterduncans',''),(903,'matt-tibett-tv-chef','Matt Tibett','matt-tibett-tv-chef.jpg','ðŸŽ¤ Matt Tebbutt is a renowned British chef and TV presenter, best known for hosting Saturday Kitchen on the BBC. ðŸŒŸ With a career spanning across Food Unwrapped and Market Kitchen, Matt brings his culinary expertise and engaging personality to screens. ðŸ½ï¸ He trained at Leith\'s School of Food and Wine and worked with top chefs like Marco Pierre White. ','TV Chef',' Photo: Bruce Davis ','',''),(904,'david-moyes-west-ham-manager','David Moyes','david-moyes-west-ham-manager.jpg','David William Moyes is a Scottish professional football coach and former player. He is currently the manager of Premier League club West Ham United. He was previously the manager of Preston North End, Everton, Manchester United, La Liga club Real Sociedad and Sunderland. ','West Ham Football Manager',' Photo: Bruce Davis  ','',''),(905,'jamie-vardy-leicester-city-england-footballer','Jamie Vardy','jamie-vardy-leicester-city-england-footballer.jpg','Jamie Richard Vardy is an English professional footballer who plays as a striker for Premier League club Leicester City. Vardy has also played for the England national team. ','Leicester City and England Footballer',' Photo: Bruce Davis ','@vardy7',''),(906,'laurie-brett-actress','Laurie Brett','laurie-brett-actress.jpg','Laurie Brett is a Scottish actress, best known for her roles as Jane Beale in the BBC One soap opera EastEnders and Christine Mulgrew in the BBC One school-based drama series Waterloo Road.','Actress',' Photo: Bruce Davis ','@LauriebrettX',''),(907,'kieron-richardson-actor','Kieron Richardson','kieron-richardson-actor.jpg','Kieron Mark Richardson is an English actor and presenter. He plays the role of Ste Hay in Hollyoaks and is also known for his role in Heartbeat as Ricky Smith. He won \"Best Onscreen Partnership\" with Hollyoaks co-star Emmett J. Scanlan at the British Soap Awards in 2013\r\n','Actor',' Photo: Bruce Davis  ','@KieronOffic',''),(908,'johnny-ball-tv-presenter','Johnny Ball','johnny-ball-tv-presenter.jpg','Johnny Ball is an English television personality, a populariser of mathematics and the father of BBC Radio 2 DJ Zoe Ball. \r\n','TV personality',' Photo: Bruce Davis ','@JohnnyBallco',''),(909,'showaddywaddy-singers','Showaddywaddy','showaddywaddy-singers.jpg','Showaddywaddy are a pop/rock group from Leicester, England. They specialise in revivals of hit songs from the 1950s and early 1960s, while also issuing original material. Showaddywaddy spent a total of 209 weeks on the UK Singles Chart, and had 10 Top Ten singles, with one reaching number one.','Singers',' Photo: Bruce Davis  ','@ShowaddywaddyUK',''),(910,'showaddywaddy-band','Showaddywaddy Band','showaddywaddy-band.jpg','Showaddywaddy are a pop/rock group from Leicester, England. They specialise in revivals of hit songs from the 1950s and early 1960s, while also issuing original material. Showaddywaddy spent a total of 209 weeks on the UK Singles Chart, and had 10 Top Ten singles, with one reaching number one.','Band',' Photo: Bruce Davis  ','@ShowaddywaddyUK',''),(911,'oliver-farnworth-actor','Oliver Farnworth','oliver-farnworth-actor.jpg','Oliver Farnworth is an English actor. Farnworth was brought up just outside Halifax in Hebden Bridge, West Yorkshire, but moved to Sidmouth in Devon when he was fifteen. He trained at the Bristol Old Vic Theatre School. He first came to recognition in Hollyoaks playing Will Hackett from September 2006 to May 2007.','Actor',' Photo: Bruce Davis ','',''),(912,'rob-rouse-comedian-presenter','Rob Rouse','rob-rouse-comedian-presenter.jpg','Rob Rouse is an English comedian.','Comedian',' Photo: Bruce Davis  ','@robrouse',''),(913,'paula-lane-actress','Paula Lane','paula-lane-actress.jpg','ðŸŽ­ Paula Lane is an English actress, best known for her role as Kylie Platt in the ITV soap Coronation Street from 2010 to 2016. ðŸŒŸ Paula\'s portrayal of the complex character earned her widespread recognition and admiration from fans. ðŸŽ¬ Now, Paula brings her festive spirit to the Santa Radio MugShots collection!cheer! ','Actress',' Photo: Bruce Davis  ','@lane_paula',''),(914,'sally-anne-matthews-actress','Sally Anne Matthews','sally-anne-matthews-actress.jpg','Sally Ann Matthews is an English actress, born on 19 September 1970 in Oldham, Lancashire. She is best known for her role as Jenny Bradley in the ITV soap opera Coronation Street, a character she has portrayed since 1986, with appearances in 1991, 1993, and from 2015 to the present. \r\n','Actress',' Photo: Bruce Davis ','',''),(915,'james-burrows-actor','James Burrows','james-burrows-actor.jpg','Actor from Derby represented by Curtis brown London','Actor',' Photo: Bruce Davis ','@JBurrowsActor',''),(916,'colson-smith-actor','Colson Smith','colson-smith-actor.jpg','Colson Smith, Actor: Coronation Street. Colson Smith was born on August 13, 1998 in Castleford, Dorset, England. He is known for his work on Coronation Street','Actor',' Photo: Bruce Davis ','@colsonsmith',''),(917,'dave-vitty-comedian','Dave Vitty','dave-vitty-comedian.jpg','David Lloyd Vitty is a radio presenter working in the UK. He worked alongside Chris Moyles at BBC Radio 1, having originally been a broadcast assistant on Moyles\' early morning show.','Comedian',' Photo: Bruce Davis  ',