making him one of the best-selling music artists of all time.','Singer',' Photo: Bruce Davis   ','@SirCliffNews','Yes'),(925,'luke-kempner-comedian','Luke Kempner','luke-kempner-comedian.jpg','This versatile performer is an actor, comic, impressionist, and singer, bringing a unique blend of talents to the entertainment world. ðŸŒŸ Known for his comedic flair and spot-on impressions, heâ€™s also a fan of music, famously knowing the entire Romeo Rap from 21 Seconds! ðŸŽ¤ Whether making audiences laugh or showcasing his vocal talents, this entertainer knows how to captivate. ','Comedian',' Photo: Bruce Davis   ','@LukeKempner',''),(926,'alan-johnson-mp','Alan Johnson','alan-johnson-mp.jpg','Alan Arthur Johnson is a British politician who served as Shadow Chancellor of the Exchequer from 2010 to 2011, Home Secretary from 2009 to 2010 and Secretary of State for Health from 2007 to 2009. A member of the Labour Party, he was the Member of Parliament for Kingston upon Hull West and Hessle from 1997 to 2017.','MP',' Photo: Bruce Davis  ','@PodcastAlan',''),(927,'john-whaite-bake-off-winner','John Whaite','john-whaite-bake-off-winner.jpg','John Whaite is an English baker who won the third series of The Great British Bake Off in 2012. He works as a chef, television presenter, and author.','Chef',' Photo: Bruce Davis ','',''),(928,'shappi-khorsandi-comedian','Shappi Khorsandi','shappi-khorsandi-comedian.jpg','Shaparak Khorsandi, formerly credited as Shappi Khorsandi, is an Iranian-born British comedian and author. She is the daughter of the Iranian political satirist and poet Hadi Khorsandi. Her family left Iran for the United Kingdom following the Islamic Revolution. ','Comedian',' Photo: Bruce Davis ','@ShappiKhorsandi',''),(929,'denise-van-outen-actress','Denise Van Outen','denise-van-outen-actress.jpg','Denise van Outen is an English actress, singer, dancer and presenter. She presented The Big Breakfast, played Roxie Hart in the musical Chicago both in the West End and on Broadway and finished as runner-up in the tenth series of the BBC One dancing show Strictly Come Dancing.','Actress',' Photo: Bruce Davis  ','@denise_vanouten','Yes'),(930,'stephen-graham-actor','Stephen Graham','stephen-graham-actor.jpg','Stephen Joseph Graham is an English actor. Graham is best known for playing Andrew \"Combo\" Gascoigne in the film This Is England and its television sequels This Is England \'86, This Is England \'88, and This Is England \'90. ','Actor','  ','@StephenGraham73','Yes'),(931,'tracy-brabin-mp-actress','Tracy Brabin','tracy-brabin-mp-actress.jpg','Tracy Lynn Brabin is a British Labour and Co-operative politician serving as the first Mayor of West Yorkshire since May 2021. She was the Member of Parliament for Batley and Spen from 2016 to 2021.','Actress',' Photo: Bruce Davis ','@TracyBrabin',''),(932,'dan-gillespie-the-felling-singer','Dan Gillespie','dan-gillespie-the-felling-singer.jpg','Daniel Giles Gillespie Sells is an English singer-songwriter and guitarist, best known as being the lead vocalist and frontman for the rock group The Feeling.','Singer',' Photo: Bruce Davis ','@DanGSells',''),(933,'lauren-patel-actress','Lauren Patel','lauren-patel-actress.jpg',' Lauren Patel is a talented British actress best known for her role as Pritti Pasha in the 2021 film Everybody\'s Talking About Jamie. ðŸŒŸ Her portrayal of Jamie\'s supportive friend earned her critical acclaim and introduced her to a wider audience. With a bright future ahead, Lauren continues to shine in both film and television. ','Actress',' Photo: Bruce Davis  ','@_laurenpatel',''),(934,'becky-measures-radio-presenter','Becky Measures','becky-measures-radio-presenter.jpg','Becky Measures is a popular radio presenter known for her engaging hosting style and connection with listeners. A familiar voice on the airwaves, Becky has a passion for music and storytelling, making her shows both entertaining and heartfelt. Her energy and warmth have won her a loyal audience across 