Nev Wilshire','nev-wilshire-tv-personality.jpg','Businessman, Speaker & Call Centre Napoleon from BBC\'s \'The Call Centre\'. Love a catchphrase, now GET OUT of my office!','TV Personality',' Photo: Bruce Davis  ','@NevWilshire_MSC',''),(941,'tim-peake-astronaut','Tim Peake','tim-peake-astronaut.jpg','Major Timothy Nigel â€œTimâ€ Peake CMG is a British Army Air Corps officer, European Space Agency astronaut and a former International Space Station crew member.','Astronaut',' Photo: Bruce Davis  ','@astro_timpeake',''),(942,'clinton-baptise-psychic','Clinton Baptiste','clinton-baptise-psychic.jpg','Alex Lowe is an English actor, comedian and voice artist. He is the creator and performer behind the character Clinton Baptiste, originally seen in Phoenix Nights, as whom he has since toured.','Psychic','Bruce Davis ','@realclintonb','Yes'),(943,'adam-english-radio-presenter','Adam English','adam-english-radio-presenter.jpg','Adam is an award winning presenter every weekday from 4pm on Union JACK Radio, Union JACK Rock and Union JACK Dance! Also now into Stand Up.','Radio Presenter','Bruce Davis ','@Adam_English_','No'),(944,'alex-horne-comedian','Alex Horne','alex-horne-comedian.jpg','Alexander James Jeffery Horne is a British comedian. Horne is the creator of BAFTA award-winning Taskmaster, a comedy panel show in which he is the assistant to \"Taskmaster\" Greg Davies, who judges comedians on various absurd tasks they are asked to perform. ','Comedian','Bruce Davis','@AlexHorne',''),(945,'ant-middleton-tv-personality','Ant Middleton','ant-middleton-tv-personality.jpg','Anthony Middleton is a British adventurer, writer, television personality and former soldier. He is best known as the former Chief Instructor on the Channel 4 television series SAS: Who Dares Wins, a role he held from 2015 until 2021.','TV Personality','Bruce Davis','@antmiddleton',''),(946,'raven-chapman-terri-harper-stevi-levy-boxers','Raven, Terri Harper and Stevi','raven-chapman-terri-harper-stevi-levy-boxers.jpg','Professional Boxer undefeated in 12 contest Boxing glove WBC/IBO World Champion. signed to matchroomboxing. Managed and coached by StefyBull. Pictured with boxers Stevi Levy and Raven Chapman','Boxers','Bruce Davis    ','@TerriHarper96',''),(947,'david-diamante-boxing-commentator','David Diamante','david-diamante-boxing-commentator.jpg','David Diamante is an American ring announcer. A popular ring announcer with DAZN, Diamante has been coined \"The Voice of Boxing\" by BBC Sport.','Boxing Commentator',' Bruce Davis','@daviddiamante',''),(948,'barry-mcguigan-boxer','Barry McGuigan','barry-mcguigan-boxer.jpg','Finbar Patrick McGuigan MBE is an Irish retired professional boxer and current boxing promoter. Born in Clones, County Monaghan, Ireland, McGuigan was nicknamed The Clones Cyclone and became the WBA and lineal featherweight world champion.','Boxers','Bruce Davis ','@ClonesCyclone','Yes'),(949,'kammy-chris-kamara-tv-personality','Kammy Chris Kamara','kammy-chris-kamara-tv-sport-personality.jpg','Christopher \"Kammy\" Kamara is an English former professional football player and manager who works as a presenter and football analyst at Sky Sports. As a player, he was known as a tough-tackling midfielder. He joined the Royal Navy at the age of 16, before being signed up to Portsmouth in November 1974','TV Personality','VoiceoverGuy   ','@chris_kammy','Yes'),(952,'nigel-ng-comedian','Nigel NG','nigel-ng-comedian.jpg','Nigel Ng, better known by his online persona Uncle Roger, is a Malaysian Chinese stand-up comedian and Internet celebrity based in London, United Kingdom.','Comedian','Bruce Davis ','@MrNigelNg','No'),(953,'damian-williams-actor','Damian Williams','damian-williams-actor.jpg','Essex By The Sea Actor . Shouts for money . Whiff in series 1&2 of Andy & The Band. Pictured with Paul Hendy','Actor','Bruce Davis ','@djwilliamsact','No'),(954,'mark-watson-comedian','Mark Watson','mark-watson-comedian.jpg','Mark Watson is a comedian, author and sports pundit. He did his first gig in 2002 and the same year won the Daily Telegraph Open Mic Competition.','Comedian','Bruce Davis  ','@watsoncomedian','No'),(955,'billy-bragg-singer','Billy Bragg','billy-bragg-singer.jpg','Stephen William Bragg is an English singer-songwriter and left-wing activist. His music blends elements of folk music, punk rock and protest songs, with lyrics that mostly span political or romantic themes. His music is heavily centred on bringing about change and involving the younger generation in activist causes.','Singer','Bruce Davis   ','@billybragg','No'),(956,'stuart-maconie-radio-presenter','Stuart Maconie','stuart-maconie-radio-presenter.jpg','Stuart Maconie is an English radio DJ and television presenter, writer, journalist, and critic working in the field of pop music and popular culture.','Radio Presenter','Brce Davis   ','@StuartMaconie','No'),(957,'adam-hussain-actor','Adam Hussain','adam-hussain-actor.jpg','Adam Hussain is a talented actor, best known for his role as Aadi Alahan in the popular British soap opera Coronation Street. His performance has garnered praise for bringing depth and relatability to his character, making him a rising star in the UK television industry. With his charismatic presence, Adam continues to captivate audiences on-screen.','Actor','Bruce Davis ','@AdamHusActor','No'),(958,'ryan-prescott-actor','Ryan Prescott','ryan-prescott-actor.jpg','Ryan Prescott is an English actor who is currently portraying the role of Ryan Connor on the ITV soap opera Coronation Street. He previously played the role of Flynn Buchanan in fellow ITV soap opera Emmerdale in 2011.','Actor','Bruce Davis','@ryanaprescott','No'),(959,'pudsey-bear-charity-rep','Pudsey Bear','pudsey-bear-charity-rep.jpg','ðŸ» Pudsey Bear is the beloved mascot of BBC Children in Need, known for his iconic yellow fur and patch over one eye, which he got from a sharp pencil accident in his youth. ðŸŒŸ Pudsey has become a symbol of fundraising and support for children in need across the UK, bringing joy and raising millions for charity. ðŸŽ… Now, Pudsey joins the Santa Radio MugShots collection.','Charity Mascot','Bruce Davis ','@BBCCiN','No'),(960,'louise-rednapp-singer','Louise Rednapp','louise-rednapp-singer.jpg','Louise Elizabeth Redknapp, is an English singer, songwriter and media personality. She was a member of Eternal, a R&B girl group which debuted in 1993 with their quadruple-platinum studio album Always & Forever. ','Singer','Bruce Davis','@LouiseRedknapp','No'),(961,'ronan-keating-singer','Ronan Keating','ronan-keating-singer.jpg','Ronan Keating is an Irish singer, songwriter and TV/radio presenter best known as a co-lead vocalist of Boyzone, who rose to global fame in the 1990s with hits like â€œNo Matter What.â€ Formed in 1994 with Stephen Gately, Keith Duffy, Shane Lynch and Michael Graham, the band became one of Irelandâ€™s biggest pop acts. Ronan later built a successful solo career and now co-hosts the popular Magic Radio breakfast show, continuing to charm audiences with his signature warmth.','Singer','Bruce Davis ','@ronanofficial','No'),(962,'joe-tasker-and-harpz-kaur-tv-presenter','Joe Tasker and Harpz Kaur','joe-tasker-and-harpz-kaur-tv-presenter.jpg','Asian Networkâ€™s Harpz Kaur and YouTuber Joe Tasker are the new presenters of CBBC\'s Saturday Mash-Up!','TV Presenter & Entertainer',' Bruce Davis ','@Saturday_MashUp','No'),(963,'peter-andre-tv-personaility','Peter Andre','peter-andre-tv-personaility.jpg','Peter Andre is a popular British singer and television personality, best known for his hit singles Mysterious Girl and Flava. ðŸŒŸ Peter rose to fame in the 90s, captivating fans with his catchy tunes and charismatic persona. ðŸŽ¤ His success has extended into television, where he continues to entertain audiences. Now, Peter brings his festive charm to the Santa Radio MugShots collection! ','TV Personality','Bruce Davis ','@MrPeterAndre','Yes'),(964,'adam-kay-comedian','Adam Kay','adam-kay-comedian.jpg','Multi-award-winning, multi-million-copy bestselling author of This is Going to Hurt & Twas the Nightshift Before Christmas, editor of Dear NHS and author of kids\' books Kay\'s Anatomy & Kay\'s Marvellous Medicine.','Comedian','Bruce Davis','@amateuradam','No'),(965,'mo-gilligan-comedian','Mo Gilligan','mo-gilligan-comedian.jpg','Mosiah Gilligan is a British stand-up comedian. After several years of uploading comedy clips to social media, he found global success in 2017. Host of the Brits in 2022 and Judge on Masked Singer 2021.','Comedian','Bruce Davis ','@MoTheComedian','No'),(966,'dermot-o-leary-radio-presenter','Dermot O Leary','dermot-o-leary-radio-presenter.jpg','Sean Dermot Fintan O\'Leary Jr is an English broadcaster who currently works for ITV and BBC Radio 2.','Radio Presenter','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>      ','@radioleary','Yes'),(968,'sophie-ellis-bexter-singer','Sophie Ellis-Bextor','sophie-ellis-bexter-singer.jpg','Sophie Michelle Ellis-Bextor is an English singer and songwriter. She first came to prominence in the late 1990s, as the lead singer of the indie rock band Theaudience. After the group disbanded, Ellis-Bextor went solo, achieving success in the early 2000s.','Singer','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>      ','@SophieEB','Yes'),(969,'santa-father-christmas','Father Christmas','santa-father-christmas.jpg','Santa Claus, also known as Father Christmas, Saint Nicholas, Saint Nick, Kris Kringle, or simply Santa, is a legendary character originating in Western Christian culture who is said to bring children gifts on Christmas Eve of toys and candy or coal or nothing, depending on whether they are \"naughty or nice\".','Father Christmas','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>      ','@wearesantaradio','No'),(970,'josie-gibson-tv-personality','Josie Gibson','josie-gibson-tv-personality.jpg','Josephine Diane Shirley Gibson is an English television personality and presenter. In 2010, she won the eleventh series of Big Brother, and later that year, she appeared in Ultimate Big Brother. She was also a regular guest host on the Channel 5 magazine series OK! TV. ','TV Personality','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>      ','@JosieGibson85','No'),(971,'michael-portillo-presenter','Michael Portillo','michael-portillo-presenter.jpg','Michael Portillo is a British journalist, broadcaster and former politician best known for his hugely popular railway documentaries, including Great British Railway Journeys and Great Continental Railway Journeys. His programmes blend history, culture and travel with his trademark warmth and insight. After a high-profile political career, Portillo has become a much-loved TV presence and storyteller. ','TV Presenter','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>       ','@portilloandhen','Yes'),(972,'joel-ross-radio-presenter','Joel Ross','joel-ross-radio-presenter.jpg','Joel Ross is a multi award winning British radio DJ and television presenter. He has worked with a co-host Jason King. He currently presents the Rock FM Breakfast Show.','Radio Presenter','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>      ','@joelrossradio','No'),(973,'pat-sharp-radio-presenter','Pat Sharp','pat-sharp-radio-presenter.jpg','Patrick Sharpin, known professionally as Pat Sharp, is an English radio presenter, television presenter and DJ. In the UK, he is known mainly for his work on the children\'s ITV programme Fun House, and his extensive radio career. ','Radio Presenter','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>      ','@patsharp','No'),(974,'amanda-lamb-tv-presenter','Amanda Lamb','amanda-lamb-tv-presenter.jpg','Amanda Lamb is an English television presenter and former model who was notable for presenting A Place in the Sun from 2001 until 2006 and You Deserve This House.','TV Presenter','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>      ','@mandilamb_01','No'),(975,'paula-wilcox-actress','Paula Wilcox','paula-wilcox-actress.jpg','Paula Wilcox is an English actress. An established actress with a career spanning over 50 years, she is best known for her role as Chrissy in the popular ITV sitcom Man About The House from 1973 to 1976.','Actress','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>      ','@PaulaWilcoxUK','No'),(976,'patricia-hodge-actress','Patricia Hodge','patricia-hodge-actress.jpg','Patricia Ann Hodge, OBE is an English actress. She is best known on-screen for playing Phyllida Erskine-Brown in Rumpole of the Bailey, the title role in Jemima Shore Investigates, Penny in Miranda and Mrs Pumphrey in All Creatures Great and Small.','Actress','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>      ','@wearesantaradio','No'),(977,'red-arrows-entertainers','Red Arrows','red-arrows-entertainers.jpg','The Red Arrows, officially known as the Royal Air Force Aerobatic Team, is the aerobatics display team of the Royal Air Force based at RAF Scampton. The team was formed in late 1964 as an all-RAF team, replacing a number of unofficial teams that had been sponsored by RAF commands.','Armed forces','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>      ','@rafredarrows','No'),(978,'right-said-fred-singers','Right Said Fred','right-said-fred-singers.jpg','Right Said Fred are an English pop band formed by brothers Fred and Richard Fairbrass in 1989. They are best known for the hit 1991 song \"I\'m Too Sexy\". Their achievements include number 1 hits in 70 countries including one US number 1, one UK number 1, and a number 1 in Japan.','Singers','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>      ','@TheFreds','No'),(979,'uefa-trophy','UEFA Trophy','uefa-trophy.jpg','The UEFA Europa League, formerly the UEFA Cup, is an annual football club competition organised since 1971 by the Union of European Football Associations for eligible European football clubs.','Trophy','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>      ','@EuropaLeague','No'),(980,'jimmy-cricket-comedian','Jimmy Cricket','jimmy-cricket-comedian.jpg','James Mulgrew, known professionally as Jimmy Cricket, is an Irish comedian. He first came to prominence as a comedian in the 1970s and has had his own shows on television and radio. ','Comedian','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>      ','@jimmy__cricket','No'),(981,'louise-minchin-presenter','Louise Minchin','louise-minchin-presenter.jpg','Louise Mary Minchin is a British television presenter, journalist and former news presenter who currently works freelance within the BBC. Beginning in 2012, Minchin was a regular anchor on the BBC One programme Breakfast, co-hosting the show three days a week with Dan Walker.','TV Presenter','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>      ','@louiseminchin','No'),(982,'sue-pollard-actress','Sue Pollard','sue-pollard-actress.jpg','Su Pollard is a much-loved British actress and TV personality, best known for her unforgettable turn as Peggy Ollerenshaw in the classic sitcom Hi-de-Hi! Her eccentric style and sharp comic timing made her a firm favourite with audiences. Beyond the series, Su has enjoyed a wide-ranging career in theatre, musicals and reality TV, showing her flair for larger-than-life characters. Her distinctive humour and energy have secured her a lasting place in British entertainment.','Actress','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>       ','@Su_Pollard','No'),(983,'paul-barber-actor','Paul Barber','paul-barber-actor.jpg','Paul Barber is an English actor from Liverpool. In a career spanning more than 45 years, he is best known for playing Denzil in Only Fools and Horses and Horse in The Full Monty.','Actor','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>      ','@PaulBarberActor','No'),(984,'linda-purl-actress','Linda Purl','linda-purl-actress.jpg','Linda Purl is an American actress and singer, known for her roles as Ashley Pfister on Happy Days, Sheila Munroe in the 1982 horror film Visiting Hours, Pam Beesly\'s mother Helene in The Office, and Ben Matlock\'s daughter Charlene Matlock for the first season of the television series Matlock.','Actress','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>      ','@lindapurl','No'),(985,'patrick-duffy-actor','Patrick Duffy','patrick-duffy-actor.jpg','Patrick Duffy is an American actor and director widely known for his role on the CBS primetime soap opera Dallas, where he played Bobby Ewing, the youngest son of Miss Ellie, and the nicest brother of J.R. Ewing from 1978 to 1985 and from 1986 to 1991','Actor','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>      ','@therealpduffy','No'),(986,'scott-mills-radio-presenter','Scott Mills','scott-mills-radio-presenter.jpg','Scott Robert Mills - English radio DJ, television presenter and occasional actor. He was best known for presenting his show on BBC Radio 2. Mills was also been a UK commentator for the semi-finals of the Eurovision Song Contest.','Radio Presenter','bruce Davis','@scott_mills','No'),(987,'matt-goss-singer','Matt Goss','matt-goss-singer.jpg','Matthew Weston Goss is an English singer-songwriter and musician. He was the lead singer of 1980s pop group Bros, which also featured his twin brother Luke as the drummer. Goss as a solo artist has released five studio albums. Goss wrote the theme song for So You Think You Can Dance, produced by Nigel Lithgow.','Singer','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>      ','@mattgoss','No'),(988,'mark-chappers-chapman-radio-presenter','Mark Chappers','mark-chappers-chapman-radio-presenter.jpg','Mark Andrew Chapman is a British television and radio presenter who, mainly working in sport, presents Match of the Day 2 on BBC One and Sky Sports\' coverage of the EFL Cup. He also hosts Saturday afternoons plus The Monday Night Club on 5 live Sport','Radio Presenter',' <a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>     ','@markchapman','No'),(989,'reginald-d-hunter-comedian','Reginald D Hunter','reginald-d-hunter-comedian.jpg','Reginald Darnell Hunter is an American stand-up comedian based in the United Kingdom.','Comedian','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>     ','@reginalddhunter','No'),(990,'richard-curts-writer','Richard Curtis','richard-curts-writer.jpg','Richard Whalley Anthony Curtis CBE is a British screenwriter, producer and film director. One of Britain\'s most successful comedy screenwriters, he is known primarily for romantic comedy films,','Writer','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>     ','','No'),(991,'george-ezra-singer','George Ezra','george-ezra-singer.jpg','George Ezra Barnett is an English singer, songwriter and guitarist. After releasing two EPs, Did You Hear the Rain? in November 2013 and Cassy O\' in March 2014, Ezra rose to prominence with the release of his hit single, \"Budapest\", which reached number one in several countries.','Singer','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>      ','@george_ezra','Yes'),(992,'dolly-rose-campbell-actress','Dolly Rose Campbell','dolly-rose-campbell-actress.jpg','Dolly-Rose Campbell is an English actress, who has played Gemma Winter on the ITV soap opera Coronation Street since 2014. The most famous of her storylines was Gemma giving birth to quadruplets.','Actress','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>      ','','No'),(993,'mark-radcliffe-radio-presenter','Mark Radcliffe','mark-radcliffe-radio-presenter.jpg','ðŸŽ™ï¸ Mark Radcliffe is an English radio broadcaster, musician, and writer, known for his extensive work with the BBC since the 1980s. ðŸŒŸ His distinctive voice and engaging presence have made him a favourite among radio listeners. ðŸŽ¶ In addition to his broadcasting career, Mark has also showcased his musical talents and written works. ','Radio Presenter','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>        ','@themarkrad','No'),(994,'michelle-collins-actress','Michelle Collins','michelle-collins-actress.jpg','Michelle Danielle Collins is an English actress and TV presenter, best known for her roles in the British soap operas EastEnders and Coronation Street. Collins played Cindy Beale in the BBC soap EastEnders from 1988 to 1998, with a two-year break between 1990 and 1992.','Actress','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>      ','@missmcollins','No'),(995,'chris-jarvis-tv-presenter','Chris Jarvis','chris-jarvis-tv-presenter.jpg','Martin Christopher Jarvis is an English actor, presenter and writer who has appeared mainly on children\'s television for the BBC since 1992, apart from 2000â€“2002 when he was working with ITV and Channel 4. In 2019 he started a radio station for children called Little Radio. ','TV Presenter','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>      ','@realchrisjarvis','No'),(996,'natalie-walter-actress','Natalie Walter','natalie-walter-actress.jpg','Natalie Walter is a British actress and writer who is best known for her film, theatre and television roles. During her career, Walter has worked with film and theatre directors including Peter Hall, Gregory Doran, Sam Mendes, Christopher Guest and Woody Allen.','Actress','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>      ','@natwalter','No'),(997,'dene-michaels-singer','Dene Michaels','dene-michaels-singer.jpg','Black Lace is a British pop band, best known for novelty party records, including their biggest hit, \"Agadoo\". the UK based part-time band, featuring ex member Dene Michael.','Singer','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>      ','@denemichael','No'),(998,'jez-edwards-tv-presenter','Jez Edwards','jez-edwards-tv-presenter.jpg','Jez Edwards is a British actor best known for his work in advertising, presenting, and acting in series such as Coronation Street and ChuckleVision. He voices Cormac in the British dub of Chuggington.','TV Presenter','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>      ','','No'),(999,'marc-elliott-actor','Marc Elliott','marc-elliott-actor.jpg','Marc Gilbert F Elliott is an English actor from Stratford-upon-Avon, England, who is known for his role as Syed Masood in the BBC television soap opera EastEnders. ','Actor','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>      ','@MrMarcElliott','No'),(1000,'tilly-ramsey-tv-personality','Tilly Ramsey','tilly-ramsey-tv-personality.jpg','Matilda Elizabeth Ramsay is an English television presenter, chef and social media influencer best known for presenting the BBC cooking show Matilda and the Ramsay Bunch on CBBC alongside her family.','TV Personality','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>      ','@tillyramsay','No'),(1001,'rose-ayling-ellis-actress','Rose Ayling-Ellis','rose-ayling-ellis-actress.jpg','Rose Lucinda Ayling-Ellis is an English actress. Deaf since birth, she is a British Sign Language user. She is best known for playing the role of Frankie Lewis, in the BBC soap opera EastEnders.','Actress','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>       ','@RoseAylingEllis','Yes'),(1002,'masie-smith-actress','Maisie Smith','masie-smith-actress.jpg','Maisie Louise Collender Smith is an English actress and singer. She appeared in the feature film The Other Boleyn Girl and played the regular role of Tiffany Butcher in the BBC soap opera EastEnders from 2008 to 2014.','Actress','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>       ','@maisie_smith_','No'),(1003,'gabby-roslin-tv-personality','Gabby Roslin','gabby-roslin-tv-personality.jpg','Gaby Roslin is an English television and radio presenter who rose to fame co-presenting The Big Breakfast on Channel 4 between 1992 and 1996. Roslin also presented the Children in Need charity telethons on the BBC between 1995 and 2004.','TV Personality','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>       ','@GabyRoslin','No'),(1004,'sara-davies-dragon','Sara Davies','sara-davies-dragon.jpg','Sara Davies MBE is a British businesswoman, entrepreneur, and television personality. She is the founder and owner of Crafter\'s Companion, a company she started while a student at the University of York.','Entrepreneur','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>       ','@SaraDaviesCC','No'),(1005,'jemma-lucy-reality-star','Jemma Lucy','jemma-lucy-reality-star.jpg','Jemma Lucy is a British reality television personality and glamour model, best known for her role in Ex on the Beach series 3 and series 5.','Reality Star','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>       ','@jem_lucy','No'),(1006,'nigel-harman-actor','Nigel Harman','nigel-harman-actor.jpg','ðŸŽ­ Nigel Derek Harman is an English actor, best known for his role as Dennis Rickman in the BBC soap EastEnders. ðŸŒŸ He has a strong background in theatre and also starred in the final series of Hotel Babylon. ðŸŽ¬ In 2013, Nigel joined the cast of Downton Abbey for its fourth series, playing the visiting valet, Mr. Green. ','Actor','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>         ','','No'),(1007,'chris-mason-radio-presenter','Chris Mason','chris-mason-radio-presenter.jpg','Christopher Richard Mason is a British journalist who is the political editor of BBC News. He is also a presenter of the podcast and television programme Newscast and the host of the radio programme Any Questions? He was formerly a political correspondent for BBC News.','Radio Presenter','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>       ','@ChrisMasonBBC','No'),(1008,'rob-rinder-judge','Rob Rinder','rob-rinder-judge.jpg','Robert Michael Rinder MBE, better known as Judge Rinder, is a British criminal barrister and television personality. In 2014, while still practising law, he began hosting the reality courtroom series Judge Rinder.  His no-nonsense approach and engaging style made him a popular figure in British TV. In 2019, he also began hosting the Channel 4 series The Rob Rinder Verdict. ','Judge & TV Personality','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>       ','@RobbieRinder','No'),(1009,'will-young-singer','Will Young','will-young-singer.jpg','William Robert Young is a British singer-songwriter and actor who came to prominence after winning the 2002 inaugural series of the ITV talent contest Pop Idol, making him the first winner of the worldwide Idol franchise.','Singer','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>      ','@willyoung','Yes'),(1010,'emiliano-marcondes-footballer','Emiliano Marcondes','emiliano-marcondes-footballer.jpg','Emiliano Marcondes Camargo Hansen is a Danish professional footballer who plays as an attacking midfielder for Premier League club AFC Bournemouth. He came to prominence at FC NordsjÃ¦lland and transferred to Brentford in 2018, with whom he was a member of the squad which was promoted to the Premier League in 2021. ','Footballer','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>       ','@EmilianoMarcon3','No'),(1011,'gracie-malloy-singer','Gracie Malloy','gracie-malloy-singer.jpg','Grace Malloy is a new music star singer & busker from Sheffield. As heard on BBC local radio.','Singer','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>         ','','No'),(1012,'wesley-nelson-reality-star','Wesley Nelson','wesley-nelson-reality-star.jpg','Wesley Nelson (born 18 March 1998) is an English singer and television personality. In 2018, he appeared in the fourth series of the ITV2 reality series Love Island, and has since competed on Dancing on Ice, The X Factor: Celebrity ,Celebrity SAS: Who Dares Wins and won The Games. Wes Nelson. Nelson in 2019.','Reality Star','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>        ','','No'),(1013,'ricky-gervais-comedian-actor','Ricky Gervais','ricky-gervais-comedian-actor.jpg','Legend! Ricky Gervais is an English comedian, actor, writer, and director. He co-created, co-wrote, and acted in the British television sitcoms The Office, Extras, and An Idiot Abroad. He also created, wrote and starred in Derek, and After Life. He is the funniest man on the planet and Santa Radio was blown away to have him stop for a MugShot Photo. Thank you Ricky.','Comedian & Actor',' Photo: Bruce Davis   ','@rickygervais','Yes'),(1014,'will-mellor-actor','Will Mellor','will-mellor-actor.jpg','William Mellor is an English actor, singer and model. He is known for his roles as Jambo Bolton in Hollyoaks, Gaz Wilkinson in Two Pints of Lager and a Packet of Crisps, Warren Stamp in EastEnders, DC Spike Tanner in No Offence, Steve Connolly in Broadchurch, Georgie in Barking! and Ollie Curry in White Van Man also Strictly Come Dancing 2022','Actor','<a style=\"color: darkgray; text-decoration: none\" href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\">Photo: Bruce Davis</a>   ','@Mellor76','Yes'),(1015,'wesley-nelson-reality-star','Wesley Nelson','wesley-nelson-reality-star.jpg','Wesley Nelson is an English singer and television personality. In 2018, he appeared in the fourth series of the ITV2 reality series Love Island, and has since competed on Dancing on Ice, The X Factor: Celebrity, Celebrity SAS: Who Dares Wins and won The Games.','Singer',' Photo: Bruce Davis   ','@WesNelsonMusic','No'),(1016,'maxwell-thorpe-bgt-finalist','Maxwell Thorpe','maxwell-thorpe-bgt-finalist.jpg','Maxwell Thorpe is a classically trained operatic singer who began singing lessons when he was 14. Britains Got Talent Finalist 2022','Singer',' Photo: Bruce Davis  ','@wearesantaradio','No'),(1017,'andy-de-la-tour-actor','Andy de la Tour','andy-de-la-tour-actor.jpg','Andy de la Tour is an English actor and screenwriter. In films he appeared in Plenty, Notting Hill, the Roman Polanski\'s Oliver Twist, 44 Inch Chest, and The Confessions, and in television The Young Ones, Filthy Rich & Catflap, Bottom, Kavanagh QC and The Brief.','Actor',' Photo: Bruce Davis    ','@Andy_de_la_Tour','Yes'),(1018,'hayley-mills-actress','Hayley Mills','hayley-mills-actress.jpg','Hayley Catherine Rose Vivien Mills is an English actress. The daughter of Sir John Mills and Mary Hayley Bell, and younger sister of actress Juliet Mills, she began her acting career as a child','Actress',' Photo: Bruce Davis   ','@hayleymillspics','No'),(1019,'rula-lenska-actress','Rula Lenska','rula-lenska-actress.jpg','Rula Lenska is a British actress. She mainly appears in British stage and television productions and is known in the United States for a series of television advertisements in the 1970s and 1980s. She portrayed Claudia Colby in the ITV soap opera Coronation Street.','Actress',' Photo: Bruce Davis   ','@RealRula','Yes'),(1020,'gok-wan-tv-personality','Gok Wan','gok-wan-tv-personality.jpg','Kowkhyn Wan MBE, known as Gok Wan, is a British fashion consultant, author, television presenter, actor, DJ, chef and event manager.','Television Personality',' Photo: Bruce Davis   ','@therealgokwan','No'),(1021,'soraya-vivian-singer','Soraya Vivian','soraya-vivian-singer.jpg','Soraya Vivian Is An Eminent English Singer & Songwriter, Â´Fierce Dance DivaÂ´, Brand Ambassador & B','Singer',' Photo: Bruce Davis   ','@SorayaVmusic','No'),(1022,'amanda-owen-presenter','Amanda Owen','amanda-owen-presenter.jpg','Amanda Owen is an English shepherd, writer and presenter. Owen and her family first appeared as regulars on Adrian Edmondson\'s 2011 ITV documentary series The Dales. Owen lives and farms on a remote farm, Ravenseat Farm in the Yorkshire Dales','Presenter',' Photo: Bruce Davis   ','@AmandaOwen8','No'),(1023,'anita-harris-tv-personality','Anita Harris','anita-harris-tv-personality.jpg','Anita Madeleine Harris is an English actress, singer and entertainer. Harris sang with the Cliff Adams Singers for three years from 1961 and had a number of chart hits during the 1960s. She appeared in the Carry On films Follow That Camel and Carry On Doctor.','Actress',' Photo: Bruce Davis    ','@TheAnitaHarris','No'),(1024,'hugh-bonneville-actor','Hugh Bonneville','hugh-bonneville-actor.jpg','Hugh Richard Bonneville Williams DL is an English actor. He is best known for portraying Robert Crawley, Earl of Grantham, in the ITV historical drama series Downton Abbey. New book: Playing under my Piano.','Actor',' Photo: Bruce Davis  ','@hughbon','No'),(1025,'rev-richard-cole-radio-personality','Rev Richard Coles','rev-richard-cole-radio-personality.jpg','Richard Keith Robert Coles FRSA FKC is an English writer, radio presenter and Church of England priest who was the vicar of Finedon in Northamptonshire from 2011 to 2022. He first came to prominence as the multi-instrumentalist who partnered Jimmy Somerville in the 1980s band the Communards.','Writer & Broadcaster',' Photo: Bruce Davis   ','@RevRichardColes','No'),(1026,'amy-dowden-dancer','Amy Dowden','amy-dowden-dancer.jpg','Amy Dowden is a Welsh professional ballroom and Latin American dancer from Caerphilly, Wales, best known for her appearances on the BBC One television show Strictly Come Dancing. Dowden joined the BBC series in 2017, and in 2019, she was a finalist in the seventeenth series with TV presenter Karim Zeroual.','Dancer',' Photo: Bruce Davis   ','@dowden_amy','No'),(1027,'suzie-dent-presenter','Suzie Dent','suzie-dent-presenter.jpg','Susie Dent is an English lexicographer, etymologist, and media personality. She has appeared in \"Dictionary Corner\" on the Channel 4 game show Countdown since 1992. She also appears on 8 Out of 10 Cats Does Countdown, a post-watershed comedy version of the show presented by comedian Jimmy Carr. ','Television Presenter',' Photo: Bruce Davis     ','@susie_dent','No'),(1028,'jackie-smith-politician','Jackie Smith','jackie-smith-politician.jpg','Jacqueline Jill Smith is a British broadcaster, political commentator and former Labour Party politician. She was Member of Parliament for Redditch from 1997 to 2010. She served as Home Secretary from 2007 to 2009 and was the first woman to hold the position. Smith was born and raised in Malvern, Worcestershire.','Politician','Bruce Davis','@Jacqui_Smith1','No'),(1029,'bez-singer','Mark Berry - Bez','bez-singer.jpg','Mark Berry, better known as Bez, is an English percussionist, dancer, DJ and media personality. He is best known as a member of the rock bands Happy Mondays and Black Grape. ','Singer','Bruce Davis','@bez_Beerspotter','No'),(1030,'ian-broudie-singer','Ian Broudie','ian-broudie-singer.jpg','Ian Zachary Broudie is an English musician and singer-songwriter from Liverpool. After emerging from the post-punk scene in Liverpool in the late 1970s as a member of Big in Japan, Broudie went on to produce albums for artists including Echo & the Bunnymen, the Fall, the Coral, the Zutons and the Subways.','Singer',' Bruce Davis','@IanZBroudie','No'),(1031,'badly-drawn-boy-singer','Badly Drawn Boy','badly-drawn-boy-singer.jpg','Damon Michael Gough, known by the stage name Badly Drawn Boy, is an English indie singer-songwriter and multi-instrumentalist. Gough chose his stage name from a character in the show Sam and his Magic Ball, which he saw on TV at a party in Trafford, Greater Manchester, in 1995.','Singer','Bruce Davis','@badly_drawn_boy','Yes'),(1032,'wendi-peters-actress','Wendi Peters','wendi-peters-actress.jpg','Wendi Louise Peters is an English actress. Peters began her acting career in theatre, with appearances in various productions including The Scarlet Pimpernel