atility have cemented his status as one of the UKâ€™s most beloved TV personalities.','TV Personality','Bruce Davis','@BradleyWalsh','Yes'),(1057,'barney-walsh-tv-personailty','Barney Walsh','barney-walsh-tv-personailty.jpg','Barney Walsh is a British actor and presenter best known for travelling the world with his dad, Bradley Walsh, on the hit series Bradley Walsh & Son: Breaking Dad, a show packed with heart and humour. He has also appeared in Law & Order: UK and Guy Ritchieâ€™s King Arthur: Legend of the Sword, highlighting his growing range as an actor. With natural charm and screen presence, Barney is steadily forging his own path in the entertainment industry.','TV Personailty','Bruce Davis ','','No'),(1058,'arielle-free-dj','Arielle Free','arielle-free-dj.jpg','Arielle Free is a British TV and radio presenter known for her high-energy style and love of music. Sheâ€™s hosted shows across MTV, Channel 4 and other platforms, and became a familiar voice on BBC Radio 1, where her upbeat presenting quickly won fans. Arielle has also appeared on Kerrang! Radio and various music events, bringing the same infectious enthusiasm. Her vibrant personality has made her a standout in the UK entertainment scene.','Radio Presenter','Bruce Davis','@ariellefree','Yes'),(1059,'vick-hope-dj','Vick Hope','vick-hope-dj.jpg','Vick Hope is a British radio DJ, TV presenter, and journalist, best known for co-hosting Capital Breakfast on Capital FM, where her lively and charismatic style won over listeners. She has also hosted The V Room, the spin-off show for The Voice UK, and competed on Strictly Come Dancing. With her engaging personality and passion for music and broadcasting, Vick has become a versatile and sought-after figure in UK media.','Radio Presenter','Bruce Davis ','@VickNHope','No'),(1060,'jordan-north-dj','Jordan North','jordan-north-dj.jpg','Jordan North is a beloved British radio DJ and TV presenter, celebrated for his relatable charm and infectious energy. ðŸŒŸ A fina