enter.jpg','Fleur East is a British singer, songwriter, and TV personality who rose to fame as the runner-up on The X Factor in 2014. Her electrifying performances and soulful voice launched a successful music career, highlighted by her debut album Love, Sax and Flashbacks and the hit single \"Sax\" ðŸŽ¶. Fleur has also showcased her versatility on shows like Iâ€™m a Celebrity... Get Me Out of Here! and Dancing on Ice.','Radio Presenter','Bruce Davis ','@FleurEast','Yes'),(1065,'hamza-yassin-tv-presenter','Hamza Yassin','hamza-yassin-tv-presenter.jpg','Hamza Ahmed Yassin is a British wildlife cameraman and presenter, known for his role as Ranger Hamza on the children\'s television channel CBeebies and his work on shows such as Countryfile and Animal Park, as well as presenting programmes about Scottish wildlife','TV Personality','Bruce Davis','@HamzaYassin3','Yes'),(1066,'kwoklyn-wan-chef','Kwoklyn Wan','kwoklyn-wan-chef.jpg','Kwoklyn Wan is a British chef, author and TV presenter celebrated for his expertise in Chinese cuisine. Coming from a family rooted in the restaurant trade, he has shared his skills through television series such as Chinese Food Made Easy and through bestselling cookbooks including Chinese Takeaway Cookbook and Chinese Takeaway in 5. With his approachable teaching style and passion for authentic flavours, Kwoklyn has become a much-loved figure in the UK food scene.','Chef','Bruce Davis ','@Kwoklyn1','No'),(1067,'jason-tindall-footballer','Jason Tindall','jason-tindall-footballer.jpg','Jason Tindall is a British football coach and former defender best known for his long-standing association with AFC Bournemouth. He played for the club in the 1990s before transitioning to coaching, serving as assistant manager under Eddie Howe during Bournemouthâ€™s remarkable rise to the Premier League. In 2020, Tindall took over as manager, further cementing his place in the clubâ€™s history. With a wealth of experience in football, Jason is respected for his 